  <data key="d16">To ensure a diverserange ofimages,we'vedeveloped aproximity scaletoguideus.We alwaysmakesure to explore the scene extensively:

- ·we pay attention to the smallest details(Close up)
- ·wecapturethemomentasithappens(Inthemoment)
- ·wegivecontexttothestory(Environment)

The majority of our images fall under the In the moment category, which is approximately 7o% of the whole.

