  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ce968eac-277b-436f-bc38-a5c744a5b1b2">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">5</data>
  <data key="d7">103</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">ba1d129d-c967-4f06-b01d-3a7257261e56</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">da15ac29d7eb92139c7d1b86a4137a6e5a3dd71476546eee8b2a7aa6a8333af3</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d15">ce968eac-277b-436f-bc38-a5c744a5b1b2</data>
  <data key="d16">Overall, our goal is to accurately document people's lives, without adhering to conventional beauty or social standards/stereotypes. Our primary aim is to capture humanity in all its unique variations without making those differences the central focal point of our imagery. We make sure to represent people in a safe and real environment. We use the correct equipment, and display safe behaviours.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
