  <data key="d15">4c05cf5a-f530-4204-9667-5914bfd0311e</data>
  <data key="d16">We include people who live with disabilitiesorimpairments(e.g. glasses, a prothesis,hearing aids ..)

We don't define a person living with a disease by their illness. Thereforeweshowindividuals living a healthy and active life within the range of their capabilities.

Visit the Addressingeveryone section to learn more about our stance throughout our brand identity at large.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
