  <data key="d15">2b87ffe3-6dc3-43b1-a32c-6dbc20e64efd</data>
  <data key="d16">We always portray animals in safe, healthy and controlled environments that adhere to guidelines and restrictions of the respective business areas.

We follow the British Veterinarian Association's guidelines on showing pets in advertising and brand imagery-learnmoreabouttheguidelines sbydownloadingthedocumentontheResources &amp;amp; Downloadspage.</data>
