  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1674bf2c9cf0ea87cf1486c7e74ea2430fd75c1f11bc8b609a1531319e2137cf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d15">92e7dfbe-0cc3-4fde-95eb-d1824563037a</data>
  <data key="d16">We always have a good mixture of nature and urban settings as well asindoorandoutdoorlocationsfor our images.

Down toearthand lived spaces Wechooseenvironmentsthatfeel easilyrelatabletothewiderpublic. Spaces and props need to feel like they're used in an everyday situation, not staged.</data>
