  <data key="d15">a16c95ce-048b-4b3f-9239-98e5e99989c4</data>
  <data key="d16">We don't show strong localized featuresineveryinstance,however recognizable backgrounds can be used if needed, e.g., when depicting a special breed only present in one region.

- When depicting a scene, we make sure to portray the spaces from a mixed range of perspectives.</data>
