  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">6783045fccba0723eb8cecd795a5f08eafd35885e192dd100426f90e0befe9d6</data>
  <data key="d14">19fd2b5c-5248-47a5-852e-2b1b1976cae9</data>
  <data key="d15">761e69f0-222b-40f2-a016-4daebb760db7</data>
  <data key="d16">Once approved, prepare your files according to the documented specifications and send them back to the same email address.

- Upload to Brand Hub 3

We'll take care of uploading your approved illustrations to the Brand Hub, ensuring they're ready to be used by employees and service providers across the organization.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

- 1 Description A brief description of the scene in three words or fewer
- 2 Color mode Color format like CMYK as well as the

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

addition of background color version

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
