<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:e149594e-eaf5-4625-b91f-7b8477073a02">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Principles Principles</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">e149594e-eaf5-4625-b91f-7b8477073a02</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370</data>
  <data key="d16">Ourimagery guidelinesarebuiltfrom the samefoundationsasourexperiencemetaphor:Seeing significance inthesmallestmoments.Weusethisasguidanceforallourimagechoices.Thestyleevokesapositivefeeling throughwarmtonesandnatural lighting.Weshowlifeatitsmostreal andvividwithsnapshotsthattell captivatingstories.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
