  <data key="d16">Thekeystyle criteriafor ourimagery iswhat we call asnapshotstyle.Thefollowing aspects helpguideus:

Realness We show humans and animals ina lively way,

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

intheirnaturalcontextandbehaviors. Photosshould neverbe staged.</data>
