<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:bb6d5ef0-c3f0-4ea3-80ac-56c819aa9b69">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Our imageryl look&amp;amp;feel</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">bb6d5ef0-c3f0-4ea3-80ac-56c819aa9b69</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370</data>
  <data key="d16">We want to capture life authentically,so ourimages should be relatable and natural.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Brightness

Softandnaturaldivergentlight for clarity Slightly desaturatedpalettefor arealisticanddocumentarystylelook

Temperature Warmtonesforrelatability

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Contrast

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Contrastforimpact

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:108c30f8-6696-4415-bf60-6aa2f8d3f7f5">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Brightness and contrast</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">108c30f8-6696-4415-bf60-6aa2f8d3f7f5</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370</data>
  <data key="d16">We want to capture Optimism through our lighting.

- ·Use divergent lighting for clarity, but avoid 'perfectly lit' scenes
- ·Try slightly higher contrast images for greater expression
- Consider using specific moments of light, such as sunrises or sunsets.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
</node>
