</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:965b8fa2-c1a8-442b-a924-09d0f5cf7d3d">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Temperatureandsaturation</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">965b8fa2-c1a8-442b-a924-09d0f5cf7d3d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370</data>
  <data key="d16">We use color and tonality to emphasize the feeling of warmth and Proximity.

- ·Ensureimageshaveanoverall warmtone
- ·Make sure color balance is neither too bright nor too pale.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:b39cd493-992f-422c-99e4-3af863526108">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The people in our images</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">b39cd493-992f-422c-99e4-3af863526108</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">ded4ae29-e5c0-417b-8c08-00855d252370</data>
  <data key="d16">Wewanttotell storiesthatfeel relatable and familiar.Forthisreason,we chooseour subjects with the aim to portray humankind in its natural facets. We don't force diversity, nor do we highlight physical or mental differences among oursubjects.

- Visit the Imagery production chapter to learn more about the people in our imagery. In the Addressing. everyone section you can learn more about our stance throughout our brand identity at large.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Introduction - Imagery.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:6503d30c-ed73-41ba-a3f2-b9ec93c4e491">
