<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:edde0eb2-ef92-43c6-9163-c773876cfb7f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Imagery production</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">edde0eb2-ef92-43c6-9163-c773876cfb7f</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">The following is a more detailed chapter for professionals, to conceptualize, organize and supervise photoshoots or searching stock imagery that reflects our imagery style.

Please note that allimages produced for Boehringer Ingelheim must be shared with our Brand A Helpdesk for approval before use and upload to the image library. Please note that all images produced for Boehringer Ingelheim must be shared with our Brand Helpdeskfor approval beforeuseand upload to theimagelibrary.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:36c43f0e-53d5-40dd-9cd0-6e0447962da0">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Scale Matrix</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">36c43f0e-53d5-40dd-9cd0-6e0447962da0</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">Using the scale matrix, we can create a wide range of images that fit our brand. Using the proximity levels, we explore different perspectives of the same scene. Through the intensity lens, we can display the full range of human emotions.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
