  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:6f235fb2-23fd-4d6a-a3a1-c141afa443d2">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Inclusion</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">6f235fb2-23fd-4d6a-a3a1-c141afa443d2</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We include people who live with disabilitiesorimpairments(e.g. glasses, a prothesis,hearing aids ..)

We don't define a person living with a disease by their illness. Thereforeweshowindividuals living a healthy and active life within the range of their capabilities.

Visit the Addressingeveryone section to learn more about our stance throughout our brand identity at large.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:84e83cea-95b5-47ae-a438-c64911ecd781">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Animals in our images</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">84e83cea-95b5-47ae-a438-c64911ecd781</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We portray animals' real lives and interactions with their owners, keeping the mood positive.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:01eb8427-aec5-47e2-bdd4-fef8892c81f1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">01eb8427-aec5-47e2-bdd4-fef8892c81f1</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">Reality

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

We depict animals in their everyday surroundings and activities, in calm or lively states.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:b08c7ab0-4690-4662-befa-9eebdd93206a">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Diversity</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">b08c7ab0-4690-4662-befa-9eebdd93206a</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We showcase animals of different ages and colors, also featuring both pure and mixed breeds.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:dc3c2acf-d082-427b-8cdc-e018cfa1df22">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Safety</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">dc3c2acf-d082-427b-8cdc-e018cfa1df22</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We always portray animals in safe, healthy and controlled environments that adhere to guidelines and restrictions of the respective business areas.

We follow the British Veterinarian Association's guidelines on showing pets in advertising and brand imagery-learnmoreabouttheguidelines sbydownloadingthedocumentontheResources &amp;amp; Downloadspage.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:96f1fcdb-accf-4378-88b0-60eee978f187">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Styling</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">96f1fcdb-accf-4378-88b0-60eee978f187</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We choose timeless and minimal styling for our images to ensure the images last a long time. Our styling helps create authentic scenes.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:10f03feb-cc23-43de-a7fd-292e6e04442c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Lived in clothes</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">10f03feb-cc23-43de-a7fd-292e6e04442c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">Clothes shouldn't look like they're brand new, they should be comfortably worn. Try clothesfrom the models' ownwardrobesorfrom fashion archives.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:cc299b0f-d509-4d32-8d45-99ef6cab8439">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Appropriate and relatable</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">cc299b0f-d509-4d32-8d45-99ef6cab8439</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">We choose appropriate yet seasonal'evergreen' attireineach scene (naturallythisislocation dependent). We always opt for comfort.and</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:70e9b93d-b009-4625-93ea-f1831b0bb519">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Muted palette with accents</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">70e9b93d-b009-4625-93ea-f1831b0bb519</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd</data>
  <data key="d16">Clothing can be almost any color(seePeople Photography: Don'tsfor exceptions) as long as it offers enough contrast withthebackaround for Safety-compliant attire We always adhere to safety measure for working environments (safetygoogles,helmets, gloves, etc.).

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Imagery Production.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:6227ab56-c57f-42cf-830e-c9c511d916cf">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">6227ab56-c57f-42cf-830e-c9c511d916cf</data>
