<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:dcfdb7c7-4d19-4841-a30a-e86f1776bf67">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">How the files are prepared</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">dcfdb7c7-4d19-4841-a30a-e86f1776bf67</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">19fd2b5c-5248-47a5-852e-2b1b1976cae9</data>
  <data key="d16">Each Scene illustration must be prepared in the specified formats.

| File type    | Color mode    | File format   | Resolution     | Color versions: background                                                |
|--------------|---------------|---------------|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Screen files | RGB           | SVG, PNG      | 1920 x 1920 px | Depending on the layout: Warm gray, secondary colors from light to medium |
| Print files  | CMYK, Pantone | EPS           |                | shades (Yellow, Blue, Red and Violet)                                     |

Accent Green is used as a Pantone color in the print version.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
</node>
