<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:39056749-1de6-4cd8-8421-9c9f5e8a0347">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">How to get Illustrations approved for the Brand Hub Library</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">39056749-1de6-4cd8-8421-9c9f5e8a0347</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">19fd2b5c-5248-47a5-852e-2b1b1976cae9</data>
  <data key="d16">Getting your Scene illustrations into the Brand Hub is easy! Just follow these three steps:

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:db0ef3c0-fd90-4a1a-96cf-c47ca4969ed0">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Design Review</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">db0ef3c0-fd90-4a1a-96cf-c47ca4969ed0</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">19fd2b5c-5248-47a5-852e-2b1b1976cae9</data>
  <data key="d16">Send your illustrations to brand@boehringer-ingelheim.com with the subject 'Approval Scene Illustration'. Our team will review and approve them to ensure they are in line with our illustration style. Please note that the inclusion in the library is checked in advance, only illustrations that are relevant for a large part of the organisation and are not duplicated will be included in our library.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:4a4779db-7c4d-455d-90d0-eb0f802fca24">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">File Preparation</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">3</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">4a4779db-7c4d-455d-90d0-eb0f802fca24</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">19fd2b5c-5248-47a5-852e-2b1b1976cae9</data>
  <data key="d16">Once approved, prepare your files according to the documented specifications and send them back to the same email address.

- Upload to Brand Hub 3

We'll take care of uploading your approved illustrations to the Brand Hub, ensuring they're ready to be used by employees and service providers across the organization.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

- 1 Description A brief description of the scene in three words or fewer
- 2 Color mode Color format like CMYK as well as the

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

addition of background color version

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">Boehringer_Ai-Scene-Illustration-Toolkit-User-Manual.pdf</data>
</node>
