  <data key="d16">Standalone illustrations are designed with a canvas size of 200 x 200 px. The longer side of the illustration must measure precisely 200 px, and the ilustration should be centered within the frame. You can scale the illustration while preserving the same proportions as the original 200 x 200 px artwork.

