  <data key="d16">In Technical illustrations, we use magnifiers to offer a closer, more detailed view of the illustration. This helps the audience understand the mechanical aspects and intricacies of the medical subject being depicted.

Magnifiers come in both round and rectangularshapes.

processes,enabling the inclusion of additional text as required. Rectangularmagnifier

