<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:4290418e-1a05-44df-99b3-443a21cf4420">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Fingernails</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">4290418e-1a05-44df-99b3-443a21cf4420</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9</data>
  <data key="d16">4

Fingernails may be included depending on the zoomlevel of the illustration. When the zoom-level is close, fingernails may be included.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:be23c449-f8c6-4eb8-b189-9f4af6b3e170">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Mouth shape</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">4</data>
  <data key="d9">guidance_document</data>
  <data key="d10">be23c449-f8c6-4eb8-b189-9f4af6b3e170</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9</data>
  <data key="d16">5

Different mouth shapes are allowed, including mouths with beards. A missing upper lip or simplified black areas within the mouth are acceptable.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
  <data key="d5">AI_Illustration_Generator_Art_Direction_Guidance_Indegene.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:20758b18-758e-40f1-8ed3-134d970d95ab">
