  <data key="d14">933ab84f-f1c7-49b2-be03-8ff145d78dd9</data>
  <data key="d16">The use of shadows should be kept to a minimum. Avoid skin tone shading and the grayish shadowing which is mixed with black.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

6</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">boehringer-ingelheim</data>
