Resource: Sunil | Name: CL-CRP-001242 | Match Text: JARDIANCE provides multiple metabolic benefits to patients with T2D while also reducing CV and renal risk | Country of Origin: Corporate | Brand: JARDIANCE | Therapeutic Area: Metabolism | Lifecycle State: Approved for Use | Indication: Type 2 diabetes mellitus | Key Message Type: Efficacy | End Audience: HCP (Health Care Personnel) | Footnotes: In a 24-week, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 637 patients with T2D, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=217) and JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=213) as add-on therapy to metformin ≥1500 mg were evaluated vs placebo added to metformin (n=207). The primary endpoint was adjusted mean change (SE) from baseline in HbA1c (%); weight loss and blood pressure reduction were key secondary and exploratory endpoints, respectively.  CV=cardiovascular; SE=standard error of the mean; T2D=type 2 diabetes. | Reference: 5. Häring HU, Merker L, Seewaldt-Becker E, et al Diabetes Care. 2014;36:1650-1659. RD-105019

