  <data key="d13">8ae5c7a21ad72bd7ca79bcb839f70161ca27edbb4037e725edbd11cb23714884</data>
  <data key="d14">c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904</data>
  <data key="d15">22d2b8d3-6bb0-4535-a733-49eec307ed35</data>
  <data key="d16">nfections and yeast infections in females.

These are not all the possible side effects of JARDIANCE. For more information, ask your healthcare provider or pharmacist.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
