  <data key="d15">e0fbc52d-23be-415f-ad52-d540014a346b</data>
  <data key="d16">It can be difficult to treat beyond the primary disease I see in front of me, and knowing the best treatment options can be difficult. I'm also not convinced that there is a difference between SGLT2is.

