<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8f9a1a45-fee2-4567-b2c2-429539306324">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">77</data>
  <data key="d7">248</data>
  <data key="d8">23</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">d0465fbf-e1bf-468e-a0fb-627399ac4c3a</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">e844453e001bc00127652ffc97aa66623c47c9bc7ee567656ba5945995b74d0f</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">8f9a1a45-fee2-4567-b2c2-429539306324</data>
  <data key="d16">The global branding system concept, 'Layers that run deep,' proudly promotes that the further you delve into the JARDIANCE proposition, the more depth and richness you will uncover.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

That depth and richness includes benefits beyond the physical and traditional concerns of T2D and heart failure to include renal, as well as emotional, worries.

In addition to the logo, typography, symbol, colours, and colour environment, the JARDIANCE branding system utilises visual styling, a set of illustrative, visual layers and graphic treatments to represent the boundless depth of the JARDIANCE brand offering. The JARDIANCE branding elements involve layering with purpose and simplicity and utilise the brand colours to engage with various audiences.

Through its consistent, purposeful application on and beyond the printed page, the branding system helps to draw in the audience to engage with and foster a more enduring and meaningful emotional connection with the JARDIANCE brand.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:bfbd7c65-e1f8-4889-aedf-627eb02b7a13">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">78</data>
  <data key="d7">111</data>
  <data key="d8">23</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">58b5f5b0-a9b6-4cd5-9631-4c9b79484464</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">283240baefe718e519dca8bf7e70842dd52d34fdcb5db2bff44444cf9419ce98</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">bfbd7c65-e1f8-4889-aedf-627eb02b7a13</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Conveys that there are more layers to JARDIANCE than originally thought
-   Works on multiple levels , addresses multiple problems, and is concerned about more than just the one-sided physical dysfunction of T2D, HF, and/or CKD
-   Focusing on this idea, and going through the effort of bringing it to life beyond the printed page (ie, creating actual experiences), builds deeper and more meaningful emotional connections with our audience</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
