  <data key="d13">1a2b29836ef2fe280112415b1a0c56cbab19367ebc090fedd808472c250db80a</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">d914bd8e-31e0-4a28-bf6b-cc8b3c687e04</data>
  <data key="d16">Logotype refers to the typographic treatment given to the brand name.

Use teal for the JARDIANCE logotype and brown for the generic name (empagliflozin).

Never use the brand name in a possessive form (eg, 'JARDIANCE's efficacy'), and do not use the logotype in a sentence.

The JARDIANCE logotype appears in teal (PMS 321C).

The generic logotype appears in brown (PMS 411C).</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
