  <data key="d16">-   Form the symbol and the basis for the 'Layers that run deep' global branding system
-   Highlight the depth and richness of JARDIANCE
- Create a sense of directed boundlessness
-   Offer a rich palette of different shapes that are consistent in their layering technique</data>
