<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:e2e649db-4f8e-4601-b097-d304bdd3e764">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">94</data>
  <data key="d7">281</data>
  <data key="d8">29</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">28f0f5a0-5174-4204-86d8-ec6b4e529e97</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">05efe3b61d5af95b561501e5323321668f67c2e7e1fc88da9b30a61dbd3999a4</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">e2e649db-4f8e-4601-b097-d304bdd3e764</data>
  <data key="d16">Be consistent! Using the JARDIANCE logo cluster correctly and consistently across all markets and communications will help establish brand recognition worldwide.

Jardiance Conversely, improper use will compromise our brand's integrity. Always use the approved artwork to ensure accurate reproduction of the logo cluster.

(empagliflozin)

Jardiance The following are examples of improper usage of the JARDIANCE logo cluster:

(empagliflozin)

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Jardiance

(empagliflozin) Do not change the typography used in the brand name.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Do not change the position or angle of the symbol as it relates to the logo cluster.

Y

Y

.

Y

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Do not place the logo cluster over similar colours that make the logo cluster hard to read.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Do not stretch the logo cluster disproportionately.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Do not change proportions of logo cluster elements.

Do not add drop shadows to the logo cluster that make it hard to read.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Do not change the colour of the logo cluster.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Never alter, add to, or recreate the JARDIANCE logo cluster in any way.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
