<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:e7a38f99-7146-4d10-acc1-300efd9bd56a">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">97</data>
  <data key="d7">107</data>
  <data key="d8">30</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">2cd78d1a-d79d-4f44-9e10-f975bd6c21d4</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">96b6f65e50b3b273f7d411422b50dfe073b70ab5356b1718b296765a49f99b3f</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">e7a38f99-7146-4d10-acc1-300efd9bd56a</data>
  <data key="d16">Make the clearance space above, below, and to the sides of the logo cluster equal to the size of the 'J' in the logotype. Keep this space free of all text, photographs, rules, illustrations, graphs, and any other graphic elements. Trimmed page edges should not encroach on the clearance space.

The only elements that can slightly run into the clearance space are the generic and, when necessary, the crystallised brand promise.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
