  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">dad7ce7f-98d1-40a1-9696-bc4ed6a1ab5f</data>
  <data key="d16">A minimum area of clearance space has been created around the JARDIANCE logo cluster to avoid crowding the brand name and to give it maximum impact on the page.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
