<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:567003f3-c169-4647-9a04-96b426094766">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">118</data>
  <data key="d7">77</data>
  <data key="d8">37</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">adc0cd5f-3623-4d8d-8dde-95430221d837</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1e2d9297321c6556efaf8c2166c2014f66ce7060dc218c684e66f3ed63f60554</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">567003f3-c169-4647-9a04-96b426094766</data>
  <data key="d16">The JARDIANCE colour environment is inspired by the colours and proportions of the JARDIANCE symbol and creates visual continuity across all executions. The multiple layers are designed to draw the viewer into the JARDIANCE world. Generous usage of the primary colour, teal, brings instant brand recognition.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
