<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:c9a08e3b-7f5c-48ee-be89-0a9b1f332dac">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">121</data>
  <data key="d7">69</data>
  <data key="d8">38</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">acfb835d-97bf-45d9-8e82-330c79132d9e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">536ff27b7530b6ffc9c572fa2269e84244fe655a93db4610daf4e09fcbe529fb</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">c9a08e3b-7f5c-48ee-be89-0a9b1f332dac</data>
  <data key="d16">It is important to use the brand palette whenever possible. Best practice is to apply colours at 100% strength for maximum brand recognition; however, tints and shades may be used to enhance visual impact where necessary in both print and digital applications.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8730a6bd-a729-4a70-8570-1809c0b133b1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">122</data>
  <data key="d7">70</data>
  <data key="d8">38</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3b09ab45-eeba-4d46-bdee-4a574aabfbae</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">2cbf776ebc1749bb6bf2f7001858a0d92066eed76b9f9b6bacbb81bd7a11e484</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">8730a6bd-a729-4a70-8570-1809c0b133b1</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Use full 100% brand colours wherever possible for maximum consistency and recognition
-   Apply tints and shades only when they enhance clarity, hierarchy, or visual balance
-   Verify colour contrast meets accessibility standards in all digital applications

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:bb9df6ce-cf39-4871-b46f-4b032addea8b">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">123</data>
  <data key="d7">68</data>
  <data key="d8">38</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">b968e3b9-cd56-4b60-9314-7ee065e01a5f</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">785fbacbe91d6515e1e364a134ff1f145ff3ebcb833553a0ea0f494b680c0642</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">bb9df6ce-cf39-4871-b46f-4b032addea8b</data>
  <data key="d16">- DON'T change R/G/B or C/M/Y/K tones manually; when changing shades, please make sure to use transparency settings (for R/G/B) or tint settings (for C/M/Y/K)
- DON'T use tints or shades in a way that reduces legibility or weakens the brand's visual impact

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1c80dfc4-10b0-4544-bc33-45625f96c778">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">124</data>
  <data key="d7">8</data>
  <data key="d8">39</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">c5703ac3-f3bf-4468-ba5c-188e44810870</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">5a7784a711e89a32919aefc7993fb951126abe87dd147da00664bdd965c27d72</data>
