  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">331a7ffa-01b4-45c3-b339-4be57f270c01</data>
  <data key="d16">Each target patient has imagery captured in various lifestyle scenarios to help emotionalise and contextualise the brand story. These images can be used across different brand pieces to create a relatable and human connection to the brand narrative. Samples are included below, though the library extends beyond these samples.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8eadce73-6d71-4164-87df-98aa755898a0">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">145</data>
  <data key="d7">275</data>
  <data key="d8">43</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">6f1a8e4b-acfd-4b2f-ae70-7c217599212e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">289926d26dad7958f89b064d738c9ff0fbc76f67a4fc746fd14d13cecf024a1d</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">8eadce73-6d71-4164-87df-98aa755898a0</data>
  <data key="d16">Images are property of Boehringer Ingelheim is subject to the following restrictions:

Any third party acting on Boehringer's behalf, including but not limited to any third-party vendors, agencies, freelancer, partners or collaborators, are expressly prohibited from modifying, altering, adapting, or further processing Outputs including but not limited by using any third-party software, generative AI tools, or machine learning technologies. This includes, but is not limited to, uploading Outputs into external AI platforms, training models on content, or applying visual transformations such as symptom changes, facial edits, or environment alterations. These restrictions exist to ensure medical accuracy, character consistency, and regulatory compliance. The Outputs are to be used as final assets only and may not serve as editable base material for any further AI-driven content generation.

Patient imagery shown is available for download and use on the DAM:  T2D + eCVD (Joana), CKD (Erik, James), HFpEF (Linda), HFrEF (Robert)

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

