  <data key="d15">86ba94a7-9124-43ad-a5c0-8e18acac2b9e</data>
  <data key="d16">Tables provide a modular approach to breaking up information in a way that draws attention to the key data. The JARDIANCE table style uses 2 different colours. One corresponds to JARDIANCE and the other corresponds to placebo.

| Selected very common and common AEs (EMPA-REG OUTCOME ® trial)   | JARDIANCE (n=4687)   | Placebo (n=2333)   |
|------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------|--------------------|
| Hypoglycaemia †                                                  | 27.8%                | 27.9%              |
| Urinary tract infecti ons ‡                                      | 18.0%                | 18.1%              |
| Genital infections ‡                                             | 6.4%                 | 1.8%               |
| Acute renal failure                                              | 5.2%                 | 6.6%               |
| Volume depletion                                                 | 5.1%                 | 4.9%               |

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
