  <data key="d15">0f41d7b3-e199-47d0-9f70-cd90ad5332f6</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Outline entire table in teal
-   Ensure JARDIANCE information is in knockout type within a fully saturated teal column using a white rule between rows
-   Ensure placebo information is filled with a 5% grey column

