  <data key="d15">19a8556f-4cdb-409b-9a71-7255350a1120</data>
  <data key="d16">Icons provide a simplified approach that can call attention to key points of information. They can be used to make information more legible when a large amount of text is required. They can be used to showcase the key information or subject of the text.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

