  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">5df593a2-f044-4f38-9d4b-ee9bd320bc87</data>
  <data key="d16">-   The icons should be 3 points, grey, and scaled accordingly
-   Each icon should have a teal dashed line following a curve
-   Icons should be easy to interpret with limited lines inside
- Icons can be filled or lined based on the needs of the design

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
