<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:c95da2ba-09f9-48b5-b7d0-e94bb76c6b13">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">190</data>
  <data key="d7">205</data>
  <data key="d8">56</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e6b8a4f1-90d9-43d2-abae-f79dc54e813e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">fab53785a49106e173b5f7b8df1c006fd9850f753dace1a2d00ed83f86427018</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">c95da2ba-09f9-48b5-b7d0-e94bb76c6b13</data>
  <data key="d16">The crystallised brand promise, as its name implies, is the distillation of the JARDIANCE positioning statement into a short, memorable phrase. Indications and data have been added over the last several years to the JARDIANCE brand story. With its broadening impact and potential, JARDIANCE is also gaining complexity, making it even more important that we express what the brand stands for with complete clarity. Recent market research across stakeholders and countries has identified one key territory.

This key territory is protection . * Protection unites individual indications to form a leadership position that ensures one global execution in the minds of our prescribers. It is a legacy of protection that helps to bring together our current indications while also allowing for new data and indications to come.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:3c3381a0-243a-4420-bcb6-4d173863614a">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">191</data>
  <data key="d7">128</data>
  <data key="d8">56</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">d090d756-c67b-42ff-8c5b-b13a8ba56395</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">d88410928b27c7afc4953e98a8678b3ea063f7194ee3da386abfd32da4573230</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">3c3381a0-243a-4420-bcb6-4d173863614a</data>
  <data key="d16">*Protection does not equate to prevention.

†  Never to be used externally. Please see next page.

Being at the pinnacle or top means that others look to JARDIANCE for leadership and inspiration. It means that JARDIANCE can stand on its legacy and data to confidently speak to HCPs about the benefits that come with a JARDIANCE prescription. It means that any new data and indications will help JARDIANCE stand even taller.

The crystallised brand promise is a clear and simple summation of the brand positioning.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:91bfe24e-4f11-4eaf-b594-868892a8a4d0">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">192</data>
  <data key="d7">4</data>
  <data key="d8">57</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">5daba59e-fd88-4f74-9364-1dd32ab89f9c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">e5dc819883d3c4b39a4a3f3054652d05bbceb23ae07f1d5f396b3cb309cce5fb</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">91bfe24e-4f11-4eaf-b594-868892a8a4d0</data>
