<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1840a433-69dc-4871-a312-95565bd55a23">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">193</data>
  <data key="d7">198</data>
  <data key="d8">57</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">245357da-52a3-477c-b1fd-35a0a881d22d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">d641a4b576a4469e6b252f13c17b4581a2532123a49ec884ed3d2bee4e97d60e</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">1840a433-69dc-4871-a312-95565bd55a23</data>
  <data key="d16">The 'Pinnacle of Protection' is internal language, not to be shared with external audiences. It is also not a tagline for any of our communication materials.

tagline use in external communication The JARDIANCE brand values and personality remain steadfast; however, the brand promise instills a new spirit of confidence, capturing the essence of what JARDIANCE stands for and ensuring that our customers perceive it clearly.

While we won't use the phrase 'Pinnacle of Protection' in any external communication, it should guide us in everything we do for JARDIANCE.

You can expect key communications that will bring the brand promise to life in our new creative campaign (debuting in 2023). The spirit of the brand promise, however, goes beyond creative to embody all aspects of the brand.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:a59bf47b-64aa-4b47-a286-52c4d8cef9f3">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">194</data>
  <data key="d7">8</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">f17d2e3e-bca7-4406-babd-8531b7e1fa37</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">7a762c731e2d16832aa3ebf856aa30345f3640991dafe36c25b9967256114ed9</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">a59bf47b-64aa-4b47-a286-52c4d8cef9f3</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

4</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:f0b04188-0076-4ec4-b4ed-5b567af7afe8">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">195</data>
  <data key="d7">94</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">89a7d627-f636-45c9-aced-13601362840a</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">7787a530726e141b4e8613c8d423cb25b45447fc1b878836bf9d237290d4b64b</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">f0b04188-0076-4ec4-b4ed-5b567af7afe8</data>
  <data key="d16">While branded communications about a product promote ideas and information, they also project an emotional impression or 'character' that can influence how the information is received.

When establishing brand character, we must define what drives the brand on the inside and how it is expressed as personality on the outside-that is, how the elements relate to one another.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b7ff68ed-a9e7-4834-b928-4127772aa734">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">196</data>
  <data key="d7">104</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">25366a17-2ca3-4936-8b3c-dc4491f9a254</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">afa315c94c15aaa824dd9d48860f95bf74df63527ec141cc300af0f468117190</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">b7ff68ed-a9e7-4834-b928-4127772aa734</data>
  <data key="d16">The underlying values and motivation that define a brand's reason for being .

For a brand to become truly distinctive, meaningful, and valued, it must infuse its brand character into every aspect of brand promotion and customer engagement. When the brand lives its values and purpose through authentic brand experiences, it creates strong and enduring emotional connections with the target audience.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:cf7d771f-414a-47d4-93b6-30561ca3cdcf">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">197</data>
  <data key="d7">143</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">dcec9675-b3b2-4832-aecd-057f15512181</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">ba56880d809f45eeeac8d9e532f1d0f06a0a018db448f616840a8e8b706f6ced</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">cf7d771f-414a-47d4-93b6-30561ca3cdcf</data>
  <data key="d16">The permanent behaviour that never changes. Identifying DNA allows us to craft an eventual brand character that is authentic .

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

The authentic brand character is not to be shared verbatim with external audiences, but is intended to shape all interactions related to the brand .

The brand character is defined as the set of human attributes and characteristics associated with the brand, giving it a unique persona in the market and in the mind of the customer. It comprises the following elements: brand values and purpose, DNA, archetype, and personality.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:e1dd1d4e-99c8-4661-8e36-257917e7861c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">198</data>
  <data key="d7">56</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">ce8146bd-0a17-4f51-b752-e32f7fbf64b5</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">22a9eb3f825cfe509f8b11697a1ea46c6622408dbfa59df580471af6798e032e</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">e1dd1d4e-99c8-4661-8e36-257917e7861c</data>
  <data key="d16">Classic psychologic disposition that categorises how individuals will always relate to the world . Identifying the archetype helps establish the territory within which our final brand character will reside.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:013e2387-945e-4977-889b-5e6dba47186b">
