  <data key="d15">649143e8-e86f-4df3-a5be-6ca8ada67fc8</data>
  <data key="d16">Committed to progressing beyond what was thought possible, JARDIANCE frees others from their burdens and liberates the greatness within so they can live their best lives.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

The JARDIANCE archetype personified 'For to be free is not merely to cast off one's chains, but to live in a way that respects and enhances the freedom of others.' -Nelson Mandela</data>
