  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d15">2ca77ce8-ffcb-4ab7-b029-41a47e9e74ed</data>
  <data key="d16">JARDIANCE takes a stand for a noble cause .

It is not: Impulsive, daring, a risk-taker that does not consider the consequences, audacious.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
