  <data key="d16">Table 1 presents the recommended dosage of JARDIANCE in adult and pediatric patients aged 10 years and older.

Table 1 Recommended Dosage of JARDIANCE

| Population                                 | Indication                                                                                                                                                                      | Recommended Dosage                                                                                                                                                                        |
|--------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Adults                                     | Reduce the risk of cardiovascular death and hospitalization in patients with heart failure</data>
