  <data key="d13">1c9d5928efcdd969abdb0c6a227e02153e75d6e20f79235dd171bdd38a8e3dca</data>
  <data key="d14">b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0</data>
  <data key="d15">44eec7c8-c635-4bf4-86f2-7a067b2ea827</data>
  <data key="d16">tion or non-fatal stroke (see Table 15 and Figures 5 and 6).  Results for the 10 mg and 25 mg empagliflozin dosages were consistent with results for the combined dosage groups.

