  <data key="d15">89249716-31d5-4658-a445-ece2378f0957</data>
  <data key="d16">a sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR &amp;lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , progression to end-stage kidney disease, and CV death. There were few renal deaths during the trial. JARDIANCE also reduced the risk of first and recurrent hospitalization (see Table 18 and Figure 13); information collected on the reason for hospitalization was insufficient to further characterize the benefit.</data>
