  <data key="d13">091eea4eceddee14e166fdd958c889903f90be55311988f969ed2f42ef2da64e</data>
  <data key="d14">b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0</data>
  <data key="d15">c389108f-c0eb-4f97-b845-83b4cf2e7b62</data>
  <data key="d16">Medicines are sometimes prescribed for purposes other than those listed in a Medication Guide. Do not use JARDIANCE for a condition for which it is not prescribed.  Do not give JARDIANCE to other people, even if they have the same symptoms you have.  It may harm them.

You can ask your pharmacist or healthcare provider for information about JARDIANCE that is written for health professionals.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
