  <data key="d15">bc1fb96c-da9b-4eaa-b65a-c00223d67e22</data>
  <data key="d16">Table 10: Treatment effect for the primary composite endpoint, its components and mortality a

|                                                                          | Placebo    | Empagliflozin b   |
