Figure 1 Time to occurrence of cardiovascular death in the EMPA-REG OUTCOME study

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Heart failure requiring hospitalisation

In the EMPA-REG OUTCOME study, empagliflozin reduced the risk of heart failure requiring hospitalisation compared with placebo (empagliflozin 2.7%; placebo 4.1%; HR 0.65, 95% CI 0.50, 0.85).</data>
