<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:038c2086-a3a9-4cb4-9161-1dcad61dbffd">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">243</data>
  <data key="d7">109</data>
  <data key="d8">49</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">838f85ec-c0f0-4676-aec7-17a3ae0762d3</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">ea04c6660d0a095e20dfeee5e16c96cf30c8a42c36809afa319218510fd7eac7</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d15">038c2086-a3a9-4cb4-9161-1dcad61dbffd</data>
  <data key="d16">- -Keep this leaflet. You may need to read it again.
- -If you have any further questions, ask your doctor, pharmacist or nurse.
- -This medicine has been prescribed for you only. Do not pass it on to others. It may harm them, even if their signs of illness are the same as yours.
- -If you get any side effects, talk to your doctor, pharmacist or nurse. This includes any possible side effects not listed in this leaflet. See section 4.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:69d751e6-a543-4592-8fb0-53a40a42c129">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">244</data>
  <data key="d7">54</data>
  <data key="d8">49</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">259a2982-73e6-4922-b7e3-25c7cdc0df45</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">832642dd1009d8856b5f4e6a8b399db10018ec97590c87bf2c34d9622b81ff9d</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d15">69d751e6-a543-4592-8fb0-53a40a42c129</data>
  <data key="d16">1. What Jardiance is and what it is used for
2. What you need to know before you take Jardiance
3. How to take Jardiance
4. Possible side effects
5. How to store Jardiance
6. Contents of the pack and other information</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
