  <data key="d27">*Change from baseline in clinical summary score (HF symptoms and physical limitations domains) of the KCCQ at week 52 was a prespecified secondary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced and EMPEROR-Preserved trials. KCCQ change from baseline to 52 weeks. EMPEROR-Reduced: JARDIANCE 5.8 ± 0.4; placebo 4.1 ± 0.4. EMPEROR-Preserved: JARDIANCE  4.51, placebo 3.18. Patient-reported outcomes measured changes in KCCQ summary scores.</data>
