<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:118">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d33">HCP/Internal</data>
  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Dosing / Administration</data>
  <data key="d27">¶¶Sustained insulin dose increase was defined as time to first increase in total daily insulin dose by &gt;20% from baseline total daily insulin dose, sustained for at least 2 consecutive visits at a minimum of 13 weeks apart, analysed in patients treated with insulin at baseline.8 ##Incident or worsening nephropathy is defined as progression to macroalbuminuria, doubling of serum creatinine, eGFR of ≤45 mL/min/1.73 m2; initiation of renal replacement therapy; death from renal disease.</data>
  <data key="d28">5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48</data>
  <data key="d9">claims_content_modules</data>
  <data key="d30">118</data>
  <data key="d34">Chronic kidney disease</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx</data>
  <data key="d14">13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0</data>
  <data key="d32">Confirmed complete</data>
  <data key="d3">Claim</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:119">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d33">HCP/Internal</data>
  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Dosing / Administration</data>
  <data key="d27">There were no significant differences between the placebo and JARDIANCE groups of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09; p=0.22) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67; p=0.16).5 ||Pooled data from 10-mg and 25-mg doses of JARDIANCE; both doses showed a comparable reduction in the risk of CV death.5 ¶Standard of care included CV medications and glucose-lowering agents given at the discretion of healthcare providers and according to recommendations of local guidelines.5</data>
  <data key="d28">5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48</data>
  <data key="d9">claims_content_modules</data>
  <data key="d30">119</data>
  <data key="d34">Cardiovascular risk / established CVD</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx</data>
  <data key="d14">13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0</data>
  <data key="d32">Confirmed complete</data>
  <data key="d3">Claim</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:120">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d33">HCP/Internal</data>
  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Dosing / Administration</data>
  <data key="d27">#In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41).</data>
  <data key="d28">5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48</data>
  <data key="d9">claims_content_modules</data>
  <data key="d30">120</data>
