  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Dosing / Administration</data>
  <data key="d27">In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -3.96 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -4.99 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg. Missing data were imputed using the LOCF approach.3</data>
