  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Mechanism of action</data>
  <data key="d27">Based on claims data sources of adult patients with HFrEF in Japan (Medical Data Vision claims registry), Sweden (nationwide administrative registries), and the United States (C212Optum de-identified Market Clarity Data). At study onset, dapagliflozin was the available SGLT2i approved for use in patients with HFrEF in the United States.2</data>
