  <data key="d27">ARR was estimated as the absolute difference in the proportion of events by treatment arm. NNT=1/ARR. NNT is per 2 years at risk.

‖ Standard of care: All patients received a RAASi unless an investigator judged that a RAASi was not indicated or tolerated.</data>
