  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Mechanism of action</data>
  <data key="d27">Primary care guidelines recommend including SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, as part of initial therapy for patients with T2D at high or very high cardiovascular risk7 ESC guidelines include SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, as Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with eCVD and T2D to reduce cardiovascular events, independent of baseline or target HbA1c6</data>
  <data key="d28">5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48</data>
  <data key="d9">claims_content_modules</data>
  <data key="d30">170</data>
  <data key="d34">Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx</data>
  <data key="d14">13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0</data>
