  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Efficacy / Clinical benefit</data>
  <data key="d27">In the EMPOWER meta-analysis, JARDIANCE reduced the risk of kidney failure by 34% and kidney disease progression by 30%.</data>
