  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d33">HCP / Internal</data>
  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Safety / Tolerability</data>
  <data key="d27">The risk of selected serious adverse events with JARDIANCE remained low and comparable with placebo in more than 20,000 patients.</data>
