  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Guideline / Standard of care</data>
  <data key="d27">The 2024 KDIGO guideline reinforces SGLT2 inhibitors as an early and foundational therapy for the management of CKD.</data>
