  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d33">HCP / Internal</data>
  <data key="d24">candidate</data>
  <data key="d25">candidate</data>
  <data key="d26">Mechanism of action</data>
  <data key="d27">JARDIANCE works by inhibiting SGLT2" which is the title of the slide and next point is "JARDIANCE reduces glucose and sodium reabsorption and increases delivery of sodium to the distal tubule</data>
  <data key="d28">5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48</data>
