<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:5edb5648-28e0-49db-9d52-3eee1980467c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Reporting of side effects</data>
  <data key="d8">54</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">5edb5648-28e0-49db-9d52-3eee1980467c</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">If you get any side effects, talk to your doctor, pharmacist or nurse. This includes any possible side effects not listed in this leaflet. You can also report side effects directly via the national reporting system listed in Appendix V. By reporting side effects you can help provide more information on the safety of this medicine.</data>
  <data key="d3">PISection</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
