2 Not evaluated for statistical significance as a result of the sequential confirmatory testing procedure 3 95% CI

4 LOCF, values after antihypertensive rescue censored

* p-value &amp;lt; 0.0001</data>
  <data key="d3">PISection</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:691c0d49-486d-4575-8859-432aa3d2c8b7">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Combination therapy</data>
  <data key="d8">14</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">691c0d49-486d-4575-8859-432aa3d2c8b7</data>
