| N                                                            | 89                                | 94                                | 91                                | 178                               | 175                               |
| Patients (%) achieving HbA1c &lt; 7% with baseline HbA1c ≥ 7% 2 | 6.7                               | 17.0                              | 24.2                              | 7.9                               | 12.0                              |
