#: 54 | Final Corrected Claim: Contraindications and precautions 
• JARDIANCE should not be used for the treatment of patients with: 
– Type 1 diabetes 
– Severe hepatic impairment 
– Hypersensitivity to the active substance or to any of the excipients 
• In patients 75 years and older, an increased risk of volume depletion should be taken into account 
