<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:bdf76d57-62ab-4497-bcfe-ff1e21b5d856">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">IMPORTANT SAFETY INFORMATION</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">disease_brochure</data>
  <data key="d10">bdf76d57-62ab-4497-bcfe-ff1e21b5d856</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">CKD_Brochure.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">c66d5608-a1a9-4ea5-8044-6599b515b904</data>
  <data key="d16">Do not take JARDIANCE if you are allergic to empagliflozin or any of the ingredients in JARDIANCE. Symptoms of a serious allergic reaction may include:

- rash
-   raised, red areas on your skin (hives)
-   swelling of your face, lips, mouth, and throat that may cause difficulty in breathing or swallowing

If you have any of these symptoms, stop taking JARDIANCE and call your healthcare provider right away or go to the nearest hospital emergency room.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">CKD_Brochure.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:77ce92c3-94ad-4458-b297-1524eb7cf503">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE ®  and the JARDIANCE ®  family global branding guidelines</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">77ce92c3-94ad-4458-b297-1524eb7cf503</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Utilise the branding system exactly as described in these global branding guidelines. Consistent use of these elements is critical to ensure a meaningful and recognisable brand experience for JARDIANCE and the JARDIANCE family worldwide.

October 2025</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:b4aae777-ca81-42d2-af78-09316ff61110">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">b4aae777-ca81-42d2-af78-09316ff61110</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">All content in the global branding guidelines is strictly confidential and not to be distributed externally. It is neither the intention of the authors of the global branding guidelines nor of the Boehringer Ingelheim/ Lilly Alliance to discuss, strategise, or implement marketing communications that fall beyond the approved indications for this product. Any promotional activities must be consistent with the approved label and carried out in compliance with all company policies, applicable laws, and regulations. Any promotional materials must be reviewed and approved locally for compliance with all company policies, applicable laws, and regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
