<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:194c9409-ba4d-4328-bf97-73a56aa8f517">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE is the solution for patients at elevated CV risk, regardless of the cause</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">194c9409-ba4d-4328-bf97-73a56aa8f517</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">CV complications are the number one cause of death for people living with T2D and/or CKD* and/or CVD 4-7

- 40% of PCPs say JARDIANCE protects patients with elevated CV risk -better than other treatment options (including Forxiga)</data>
