  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   The CRM system is connected-and the heart is at the center of it all
-   Reducing the risk of CV death should be a priority for all patients with CRM conditions
-   Your patients are depending on you for protection

*This is internal, aspirational campaign language. Please do not use this copy in external materials. † JARDIANCE provides broad protection by reducing risk for people living with CKD, HF, or T2D with eCVD.

JARDIANCE is the heart of protection

-   JARDIANCE has been protecting † patients for 10 years
-   The benefits of JARDIANCE have been proven across multiple trials</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:f03e7084-be42-46dc-8a0d-44e82f25d34c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Intervene early with JARDIANCE</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">12</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
