  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   JARDIANCE works quickly to protect † patients
-   The sooner you start patients on JARDIANCE, the longer they can benefit
-   JARDIANCE allows patients to live longer and do more

JARDIANCE is an easy and foundational choice across indications

-   JARDIANCE is recommended by multiple guidelines as a foundational treatment
-   JARDIANCE fits easily into your treatment algorithm and can be used with other commonly prescribed medications

Don't delay, start JARDIANCE today

-   Choose JARDIANCE to protect †  patients' futures</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
