  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Anthem is the most impactful concept for motivating early action and change, which is crucial for JARDIANCE to shift entrenched prescribing behaviours, especially in specialties like nephrology and cardiology</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:5bf54b1d-24be-4d16-adec-1b776005023a">
