  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The unique, impactful visual of Anthem stands out and gives JARDIANCE a platform for driving change. Even as it polarises, it creates meaningful brand recall and stopping power</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
