<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:4c8d0ac7-0a8a-4fb3-bc6e-81d4f86ad440">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The WRONG way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">16</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">4c8d0ac7-0a8a-4fb3-bc6e-81d4f86ad440</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">- DON'T alter the position or the size of the headline
- DON'T use the headline and visual without supporting copy
- DON'T alter the weight or the font size of the supporting copy in relation to the headline
- DON'T adjust the ratio of colours or modify the graphic treatment</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:a958986f-e706-41f2-86e5-4dfccb6e594e">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Important note</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">16</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">a958986f-e706-41f2-86e5-4dfccb6e594e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Please ensure that the localized version of the campaign claim complies with all applicable local MLR requirements.

Translation : Keep translated copy, color, and placement as close as possible to the original. Changes should only be made if required by local MLR (Medical, Legal, Regulatory) standards.

Review Process : The localized headline must be reviewed with your Country Point of Contact (CPC), and MLR teams to confirm that it accurately reflects the campaign enhancement and is suitable for local use.

Documentation : Ensure that all materials are uploaded to the appropriate system with correct disclaimers, prescribing information, and translation certifications where applicable.

Final usage of the claim may depend on local market conditions and country-specific laws and requirements .</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
