  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Full likeness rights have not been secured for the four doctor images included in this campaign. All usage must ensure that any portion above the bridge of the nose is cropped or obscured to remain compliant with licensing restrictions.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

