  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">- DON'T introduce animation styles, transitions, or effects that fall outside the established brand look and feel
- DON'T apply graphic treatments to visuals or scenes unrelated to the campaign story

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
