</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:0ed2ed37-a104-44f6-bd64-3c7927606a5d">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Emotional hook overview:</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">20</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">0ed2ed37-a104-44f6-bd64-3c7927606a5d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">At the outset of every sales call, the emotional hook helps to reinforce the JARDIANCE brand promise and enhance our campaign message.

The emotional hook effectively addresses the previously missing patient perspective in the Anthem campaign visual. Together with the campaign, the emotional hook sets up the conversation to explore data and real-world evidence in more detail and motivates HCPs to learn more about JARDIANCE.

The emotional hook helps to drive the desired mindset shift by putting the patient at the center, reframing future risk as a present threat, and anchoring on the HCP's instinct to protect patients.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:e4ee8634-2d11-4c03-8cae-35c54c5233d6">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">20</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e4ee8634-2d11-4c03-8cae-35c54c5233d6</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   The emotional hook should be used only in the iVA and congress materials to ensure maximum emotional impact
-   In the iVA, the emotional hook should directly follow the campaign home page
-   The Anthem campaign should always be included with the emotional hook

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:629c9408-7aff-4bb9-b96e-8ed30150c47f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The WRONG way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">20</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">629c9408-7aff-4bb9-b96e-8ed30150c47f</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">- DON'T use the emotional hook without the Anthem campaign

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
