<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:9d261577-0b74-4259-93c3-d08274d76938">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE symbol reflects boundless depth</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">26</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">9d261577-0b74-4259-93c3-d08274d76938</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The layered angles and curves of the JARDIANCE symbol come together as a reminder that JARDIANCE is a brand with boundless depth and richness.

These layers, which run deep in the symbol, were the inspiration for other elements of the JARDIANCE global branding system. Therefore, the symbol serves as a true foundation that strengthens the JARDIANCE branding as a whole.

On closer examination, you can see that the flowing, curved contours sweep the sides of the symbol, giving it a smooth and inviting, organic shape. Lines converge, carving sharp angles that give the symbol a crisp, energised feeling.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:b67b0ad2-e829-4a57-ad91-784e09fa6208">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The curves and angles work collectively to:</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">26</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">b67b0ad2-e829-4a57-ad91-784e09fa6208</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Form the symbol and the basis for the 'Layers that run deep' global branding system
-   Highlight the depth and richness of JARDIANCE
- Create a sense of directed boundlessness
-   Offer a rich palette of different shapes that are consistent in their layering technique</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:3e6c5cf6-7cc2-4c89-8790-c10880d7901f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">There are 2 layers:</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">26</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3e6c5cf6-7cc2-4c89-8790-c10880d7901f</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">- One in yellow
- The other in teal

The brown tint gives the elements a layered effect, which speaks to the depth of the brand and the way it adds richness to the lives of patients.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
