<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:8c928918-d099-4553-9210-1125577645c1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Logo cluster: minimum size</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">31</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">8c928918-d099-4553-9210-1125577645c1</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;

To maintain legibility, keep the logo cluster at least 1 in (25.4 mm) in width</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:9079e23c-0f8c-4ccb-ae30-2cac320adf41">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Logo cluster variations</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">31</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">9079e23c-0f8c-4ccb-ae30-2cac320adf41</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The following are approved variations of the JARDIANCE logo cluster. You may use these when the background or type of a piece (eg, fax page) does not allow for the usage of the 4-colour logo.

Never alter, add to, or recreate the JARDIANCE logo cluster.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

4-colour logo cluster Greyscale logo cluster The minimum width is:

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

- 1 mm for print
- 25.4 mm for digital

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Knockout logo cluster</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
