<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:e8f35e26-cca8-418c-ba00-d2b1847beab8">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The Boehringer Ingelheim/ Lilly Alliance: logo use</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">32</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e8f35e26-cca8-418c-ba00-d2b1847beab8</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">When the Boehringer Ingelheim logo and Lilly logo appear on the same surface, for non-product branded purposes, place the former in the bottom left corner and the latter in the bottom right corner. Try to preserve as much horizontal distance as possible between them.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Preserve a clear space around both logos, equal in space, with dimensions equal to the diameter of the Boehringer Ingelheim logogram.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
