<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:45a5dd47-78cc-4545-8be4-f313bc343972">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Callout style</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">34</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">45a5dd47-78cc-4545-8be4-f313bc343972</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Callouts should be used to emphasise a key statistic, close out a section of content, or guide the viewer to read more on the next page.

Callouts should be centered text housed between 2 thin yellow rules. As needed, an icon can be incorporated that connects with the content being discussed. See specific guidance below.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
