  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;

-   Use teal text for headlines and callouts on light backgrounds
-   Use brown text for body copy, references, and footnotes
-   Use knockout text on dark backgrounds
-   The JARDIANCE brand name should appear in ALL CAPS
-   For digital: always balance readability
-   For PowerPoint: always use Arial
-   Be mindful of the contrast between the colour used for the copy vs that used for the surrounding background
-   Always ensure the legibility of all text
-   All copy should be tracked at +20
- DON'T distort the font by stretching it vertically or horizontally

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:78f1fb00-f82b-4271-8597-f7d46ae9ff92">
