<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:e493fe94-1f99-469f-8493-2c4e22b1bc2c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Colour palette</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">36</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e493fe94-1f99-469f-8493-2c4e22b1bc2c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The power of colour is often underestimated in branding. Different colours and different combinations of colours cause different emotional and psychologic reactions.

The JARDIANCE brand colour palette is a strong reflection of the proactive, brave, and energising personality of the brand. It uses a combination of high-contrasting colours: teal, yellow, and brown.

Codes for each colour and/or gradient range are provided within each colour swatch.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
