<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:2ff65104-4379-4a7c-a540-c9b1f70a2ec1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Layers of protection: technical instructions</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">39</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">2ff65104-4379-4a7c-a540-c9b1f70a2ec1</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16"></data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:0ffa8c47-f86b-4721-88cb-2c47bf438bfb">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">About the layers of protection</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">39</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">0ffa8c47-f86b-4721-88cb-2c47bf438bfb</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The Layers of Protection element features an evolved version of the page architecture to represent a holistic focus on the 3 key components of CRM protection: cardio, renal, and metabolic. It is used to emotionalise core JARDIANCE information and highlight the types of patients who the brand is able to protect.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:c1e1e362-b99d-461d-8082-b89d2f65f27d">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Follow these examples:</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">39</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">c1e1e362-b99d-461d-8082-b89d2f65f27d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">You may apply the 3 layers as a frame to house a lifestyle image or as a block of the JARDIANCE teal to highlight key data points (see examples on previous page). The 3 layers are meant to be used in conjunction with the page architecture for print pieces; however, in the iVA these elements may compete. If space is limited, the page architecture should be used instead of the 3 layers.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:be56b749-471b-4fe4-ae8c-c0e1a14b88b4">
