<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:a3b8e037-fa73-4533-bfad-01239990e7ef">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Page architecture</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">40</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">a3b8e037-fa73-4533-bfad-01239990e7ef</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Page architecture is an element of visual styling that allows the audience to readily identify a brand by sight.

Page architecture should draw on other branding elements, such as the symbol, to create a distinct look and feel that supports the intention of the communication.

It is important for the page architecture to demonstrate versatility and be flexible enough to work across a variety of media, including digital, print, and experiential. It should also allow for use in landscape and portrait formats for pieces as small as a postcard or as large as a billboard.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:f5950d36-1f86-4f9f-9f08-a182b82b99b7">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE depth unfolds</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">40</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">f5950d36-1f86-4f9f-9f08-a182b82b99b7</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">As if unfolded from the JARDIANCE symbol, both in form and colour, the page architecture embodies the deep layers of the brand. Its boundless nature is also seen in the layers stepping off of the page. Regardless of the medium or layout orientation, the page architecture should always be present.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:c2574437-58c0-4360-a8f9-99e493ad1651">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Use a 3-layered graphic once (in any corner), preferably the top right.</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">40</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">c2574437-58c0-4360-a8f9-99e493ad1651</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">This page architecture is approved for use across all print and digital materials.

The JARDIANCE page architecture uses a layered sequence. Use a full saturation of the 3 colours: yellow, teal, and grey. The 3 colours, when grouped together, become a layer. Without this graphic trio, the page architecture is incomplete.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
