  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">You may apply the page architecture to any corner of the page; however, the top right is preferred. Do not alter the proportions or sizing of the page architecture as per the examples given.</data>
