<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:16e8cdd0-4601-48dc-846d-fe1921cdc8d4">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">About the target patient images</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">42</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">16e8cdd0-4601-48dc-846d-fe1921cdc8d4</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Target patient images have been created for each indication. For some indications, the target patient is available in three age variations: earlystage patient, mid-stage patient, and late-stage patient. Additional ethnic variations of each target patient are available and should be selected based on the needs and preferences of the local market. The target patient is always linked to a specific HCP customer and used to illustrate patient profiles and case studies.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:053ef8fe-31d7-4704-bb3f-d2d4dd78ab33">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">42</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">053ef8fe-31d7-4704-bb3f-d2d4dd78ab33</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Use the appropriate target patient for the relevant indication and HCP audience
-   Select the correct age variation (early, mid, late) based on the scenario or data being presented when applicable
-   Use appropriate disclaimer language as directed by MLR for AI-generated image usage

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
