<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:f29f17c8-0cc5-4238-be6a-213beeaeadb7">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE lifestyle imagery (cont'd)</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">44</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">f29f17c8-0cc5-4238-be6a-213beeaeadb7</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">If you are unable to find a suitable image from the provided image library, use the guidelines below to select a new image from stock that suits your needs.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:69d9e86a-e190-4f40-a50d-7cf70d085767">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">44</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">69d9e86a-e190-4f40-a50d-7cf70d085767</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Photos should feel natural, never a forced pose
-   Patients should be active or actively engaged
-   Patients should be reflective of target patient
-   Patients should be between ages 40 to 65
-   Patients need to be overweight and not slender but should not appear to have a body mass index (BMI) that classifies them as obese per local guidelines (ie, US BMI &amp;gt;30)
-   Images should be in more neutral or muted colours
-   Select photos with clean, open backgrounds without distracting elements

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:ffed341c-5a52-4700-9531-588f0e9822fc">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The WRONG way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">44</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">ffed341c-5a52-4700-9531-588f0e9822fc</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">- DON'T select images where patients are looking directly at the camera
- DON'T select black and white images
- DON'T select images where the patient looks too happy or joyful
- DON'T select images where the patient looks depressed, sad, or sickly</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
