  <data key="d16">-   Ensure JARDIANCE data are in knockout type within a teal arrow
-   Ensure placebo information is a grey stroke
-   Use arrows as shown for the bar designs
-   Use teal for X and Y axis numbers
-   Use brown for axis labels

