<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:54a88882-5bcc-4f06-808f-78cfebd0e570">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Tables</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">48</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">54a88882-5bcc-4f06-808f-78cfebd0e570</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Tables provide a modular approach to breaking up information in a way that draws attention to the key data. The JARDIANCE table style uses 2 different colours. One corresponds to JARDIANCE and the other corresponds to placebo.

| Selected very common and common AEs (EMPA-REG OUTCOME ® trial)   | JARDIANCE (n=4687)   | Placebo (n=2333)   |
|------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------|--------------------|
| Hypoglycaemia †                                                  | 27.8%                | 27.9%              |
| Urinary tract infecti ons ‡                                      | 18.0%                | 18.1%              |
| Genital infections ‡                                             | 6.4%                 | 1.8%               |
| Acute renal failure                                              | 5.2%                 | 6.6%               |
| Volume depletion                                                 | 5.1%                 | 4.9%               |

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:876f142b-92fc-47d0-ae92-932951821984">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The JARDIANCE way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">48</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">876f142b-92fc-47d0-ae92-932951821984</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">-   Outline entire table in teal
-   Ensure JARDIANCE information is in knockout type within a fully saturated teal column using a white rule between rows
-   Ensure placebo information is filled with a 5% grey column

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:4ddfa53e-30c6-4dfb-bb8b-d93a074d7849">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The WRONG way</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
