<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:55037364-6034-4112-8191-e20419b48e5c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE brand positioning</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">55</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">55037364-6034-4112-8191-e20419b48e5c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">In the case of JARDIANCE, with its robust scientific platform, positioning guides how the new data and new brand indications will be embraced by the community in the future. By establishing a strong and aspirational positioning, we can create a distinct need for JARDIANCE in the minds of customers that, regardless of new indications or clinical data, will remain true over the long term.

The JARDIANCE positioning statement must drive everything we do and say in representing our brand.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:d8670ad1-1317-4479-b9c9-a5fc7af80706">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE positioning statement</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">55</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">d8670ad1-1317-4479-b9c9-a5fc7af80706</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">| Audience              | For those whose pressures in life are amplified by the physical and emotional overload and the consequences of type 2 diabetes, heart failure, and/or kidney disease   |
|-----------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Frame of reference    | JARDIANCE is the multisystem de-stressor, which                                                                                                                        |
| Competition           | Compared to the treatments that focus on a single physical disease                                                                                                     |
| Promise               | Rapidly restores one's sense of well-being                                                                                                                             |
| Reasons to believe    | Because JARDIANCE works on multiple factors to rebalance the interconnected cardiac, renal, and metabolic system and increase life expectancy                          |
| Emotional end benefit | So that the pressures of disease can be exchanged for a greater command over today and for longer, more optimistic tomorrows                                           |</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:54fa65d8-171e-4a41-9c1d-5f3d753ca666">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">56</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">54fa65d8-171e-4a41-9c1d-5f3d753ca666</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:e6b8a4f1-90d9-43d2-abae-f79dc54e813e">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE crystallised brand promise</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">56</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e6b8a4f1-90d9-43d2-abae-f79dc54e813e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The crystallised brand promise, as its name implies, is the distillation of the JARDIANCE positioning statement into a short, memorable phrase. Indications and data have been added over the last several years to the JARDIANCE brand story. With its broadening impact and potential, JARDIANCE is also gaining complexity, making it even more important that we express what the brand stands for with complete clarity. Recent market research across stakeholders and countries has identified one key territory.

This key territory is protection . * Protection unites individual indications to form a leadership position that ensures one global execution in the minds of our prescribers. It is a legacy of protection that helps to bring together our current indications while also allowing for new data and indications to come.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:d090d756-c67b-42ff-8c5b-b13a8ba56395">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The Pinnacle of Protection †</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">56</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">d090d756-c67b-42ff-8c5b-b13a8ba56395</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">*Protection does not equate to prevention.

†  Never to be used externally. Please see next page.

Being at the pinnacle or top means that others look to JARDIANCE for leadership and inspiration. It means that JARDIANCE can stand on its legacy and data to confidently speak to HCPs about the benefits that come with a JARDIANCE prescription. It means that any new data and indications will help JARDIANCE stand even taller.

The crystallised brand promise is a clear and simple summation of the brand positioning.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:5daba59e-fd88-4f74-9364-1dd32ab89f9c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">57</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">5daba59e-fd88-4f74-9364-1dd32ab89f9c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:245357da-52a3-477c-b1fd-35a0a881d22d">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Crystallised brand promise: implications</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">57</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">245357da-52a3-477c-b1fd-35a0a881d22d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The 'Pinnacle of Protection' is internal language, not to be shared with external audiences. It is also not a tagline for any of our communication materials.

tagline use in external communication The JARDIANCE brand values and personality remain steadfast; however, the brand promise instills a new spirit of confidence, capturing the essence of what JARDIANCE stands for and ensuring that our customers perceive it clearly.

While we won't use the phrase 'Pinnacle of Protection' in any external communication, it should guide us in everything we do for JARDIANCE.

You can expect key communications that will bring the brand promise to life in our new creative campaign (debuting in 2023). The spirit of the brand promise, however, goes beyond creative to embody all aspects of the brand.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:f17d2e3e-bca7-4406-babd-8531b7e1fa37">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">58</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">f17d2e3e-bca7-4406-babd-8531b7e1fa37</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

4</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
