<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:99b49aba-690e-43e0-a524-e6c2be44526b">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">JARDIANCE brand DNA</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">62</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">99b49aba-690e-43e0-a524-e6c2be44526b</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The boundless nature of JARDIANCE comes through in multiple areas. For example, JARDIANCE is boundless in its vision, its performance, its potential, and in the possibilities it provides to its patients.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

At its core, JARDIANCE is BOUNDLESS-defined as vast, limitless, and without boundaries.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
