<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:e6f53908-a57e-4c29-9795-d193bce41745">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">The liberating hero</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">63</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e6f53908-a57e-4c29-9795-d193bce41745</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">Committed to progressing beyond what was thought possible, JARDIANCE frees others from their burdens and liberates the greatness within so they can live their best lives.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

The JARDIANCE archetype personified 'For to be free is not merely to cast off one's chains, but to live in a way that respects and enhances the freedom of others.' -Nelson Mandela</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
