  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">There are times when JARDIANCE will appear with SYNJARDY and/or GLYXAMBI in promotion. The rules for these combinations can be found on the following pages. Be sure to follow the rules to ensure consistent branding, whenever and wherever any combination of family brands is used.

