<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:2398bee7-e1c2-4077-9d41-be35bd678f41">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Logo cluster</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">70</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">2398bee7-e1c2-4077-9d41-be35bd678f41</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">b5acf5ff-42d8-4d92-bba4-931955176f5b</data>
  <data key="d16">The logo cluster brings all of the logo elements together: the logotype, colours, registration mark, symbol, and generic name (where appropriate).

The SYNJARDY logotype and registration mark appear in teal (PMS 321C).

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

The generic name appears in brown (PMS 411C).

To ensure brand consistency across all markets, the logo cluster must not be altered.

The symbol appears in brown (PMS 411C), teal (PMS 321C), and orange (PMS 716C).</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">JARDIANCE Brand Book 2025.pdf</data>
</node>
