| Body Weight                                                  |                         |                         |                 |
| Baseline mean in kg                                          | 82                      | 82                      | 80              |
| % change from baseline (adjusted mean)                       | -2.5                    | -2.9                    | -0.5            |
| Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) (95% CI)             | -2.0 b (-2.6, -1.4)     | -2.5 b (-3.1, -1.9)     | --              |

At Week 24, the systolic blood pressure was statistically significantly reduced compared to placebo by -4.1 mmHg (placebo-corrected, p-value &amp;lt;0.0001) for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -4.8 mmHg (placebo-corrected, pvalue &amp;lt;0.0001) for JARDIANCE 25 mg.</data>
