  <data key="d14">b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0</data>
  <data key="d16">A total of 1,364 patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus participated in a double-blind, randomized, activecontrolled trial to evaluate the efficacy of JARDIANCE in combination with metformin as initial therapy compared to the corresponding individual components.</data>
