  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">| MINIMUM PARTICULARS TO APPEAR ON BLISTERS OR STRIPS   |
|-------------------------------------------------------|
| Blisters (perforated)                                 |

| 1.   | NAME OF THE MEDICINAL PRODUCT   |
