| Change from baseline 1                                       | 0.06                              | -0.46                             | -0.63                             | 0.05                              | -0.37                             |
| Difference from placebo 1 (95% CI)                           |                                   | -0.52* (-0.72, -0.32)             | -0.68* (-0.88, -0.49)             |                                   | -0.42* (-0.56, -0.28)             |
| N                                                            | 89                                | 94                                | 91                                | 178                               | 175                               |
| Patients (%) achieving HbA1c &lt; 7% with baseline HbA1c ≥ 7% 2 | 6.7                               | 17.0                              | 24.2                              | 7.9                               | 12.0                              |
| N                                                            | 95                                | 98                                | 97                                | 187                               | 187                               |
| Body Weight (kg) 2                                           |                                   |                                   |                                   |                                   |                                   |
| Baseline (mean)                                              | 86.00                             | 92.05                             | 88.06                             | 82.49                             | 83.22                             |</data>
