  <data key="d16">Name and address of the manufacturer(s) responsible for batch release

Boehringer Ingelheim Pharma GmbH &amp;amp; Co. KG Binger Strasse 173 55216 Ingelheim am Rhein Germany

Boehringer Ingelheim Hellas Single Member S.A. 5th km Paiania - Markopoulo Koropi Attiki, 19441 Greece

