<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:9e809331-41e8-495e-a37c-baa0b3c3bf62">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Type 2 diabetes mellitus</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">49</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">9e809331-41e8-495e-a37c-baa0b3c3bf62</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- Jardiance is used to treat type 2 diabetes in adults and children aged 10 years and older that cannot be controlled by diet and exercise alone.
- Jardiance can be used without other medicines in patients who cannot take metformin (another diabetes medicine).
- Jardiance can also be used with other medicines for the treatment of diabetes. These may be medicines taken by mouth or given by injection such as insulin.

Jardiance works by blocking the SGLT2 protein in your kidneys. This causes blood sugar (glucose) to be removed in your urine. Thereby Jardiance lowers the amount of sugar in your blood.

This medicine can also help prevent heart disease in patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus.

It is important that you continue with your diet and exercise plan as told by your doctor, pharmacist or nurse.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:ac52500a-a8f9-4bfd-a665-9b0473b7dea9">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Heart failure</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">49</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">ac52500a-a8f9-4bfd-a665-9b0473b7dea9</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- Jardiance is used to treat heart failure in adult patients with symptoms due to impaired heart function.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:35612ba8-2bc1-46ef-a093-8a218bb4b53f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Chronic kidney disease</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">49</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">35612ba8-2bc1-46ef-a093-8a218bb4b53f</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- Jardiance is used to treat chronic kidney disease in adult patients.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:33a8d98a-f8d6-460e-a0a4-7434bf8256cc">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">What is type 2 diabetes?</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">50</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">33a8d98a-f8d6-460e-a0a4-7434bf8256cc</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">Type 2 diabetes is a disease that comes from both your genes and your lifestyle. If you have type 2 diabetes, your pancreas does not make enough insulin to control the level of glucose in your blood, and your body is unable to use its own insulin effectively. This results in high levels of glucose in your blood which can lead to medical problems like heart disease, kidney disease, blindness, and poor circulation in your limbs.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:7f4bc599-9777-4a56-b4a2-0107e3fafb23">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">What is heart failure?</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">50</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">7f4bc599-9777-4a56-b4a2-0107e3fafb23</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">Heart failure occurs when the heart is too weak or stiff and cannot work properly. This can lead to serious medical problems and need for hospital care. The most common symptoms of heart failure are feeling breathless, feeling tired or very tired all the time, and ankle swelling.

Jardiance helps protect your heart from getting weaker and improves your symptoms.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:bc0e6856-6e6c-414d-9cc3-cfc13f3edf91">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">What is chronic kidney disease?</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">50</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">bc0e6856-6e6c-414d-9cc3-cfc13f3edf91</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">Chronic kidney disease is a long-term condition. It might be caused by other diseases such as diabetes and high blood pressure or even by your own immune system attacking the kidneys. When you have chronic kidney disease, your kidneys may gradually lose their ability to clean and filter the blood properly. This can lead to serious medical problems such as swollen legs, heart failure or need for hospital care.

Jardiance helps protect your kidneys from losing their function.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:38800866-fa6e-4c91-81a4-381a4acbe1e1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">2. What you need to know before you take Jardiance</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">50</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">38800866-fa6e-4c91-81a4-381a4acbe1e1</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16"></data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:a6385330-c157-4be8-952c-7fe551b2dd4c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Do not take Jardiance</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">50</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">a6385330-c157-4be8-952c-7fe551b2dd4c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- if you are allergic to empagliflozin or any of the other ingredients of this medicine (listed in section 6).</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
