<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:c393d8de-b447-4a59-8c9f-42939da54f45">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">What Jardiance contains</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">54</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">c393d8de-b447-4a59-8c9f-42939da54f45</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- -The active substance is empagliflozin.
- -Each tablet contains 10 mg or 25 mg empagliflozin.
- -The other ingredients are:
- -tablet core: lactose monohydrate (see end of section 2 under 'Jardiance contains lactose'), microcrystalline cellulose, hydroxypropylcellulose, croscarmellose sodium (see end of section 2 under 'Jardiance contains sodium'), colloidal anhydrous silica, magnesium stearate</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:c17e4c69-474f-450d-a1dd-1fb8e8427499">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">55</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">c17e4c69-474f-450d-a1dd-1fb8e8427499</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">- -film-coating: hypromellose, titanium dioxide (E171), talc, macrogol (400), iron oxide yellow (E172)</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:jardiance:section:233e445c-463b-47e5-af90-9f0adacfe257">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">What Jardiance looks like and contents of the pack</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">55</data>
  <data key="d9">product_information</data>
  <data key="d10">233e445c-463b-47e5-af90-9f0adacfe257</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40</data>
  <data key="d16">Jardiance 10 mg film-coated tablets are round, pale yellow, biconvex and bevel-edged. They have 'S10' on one side and the Boehringer Ingelheim logo on the other side. The tablets are 9.1 mm in diameter.

Jardiance 25 mg film-coated tablets are oval, pale yellow and biconvex. They have 'S25' on one side and the Boehringer Ingelheim logo on the other side. The tablet is 11.1 mm long and has a width of 5.6 mm.

Jardiance tablets are available in PVC/aluminium perforated unit dose blisters. The pack sizes are 7 × 1, 10 × 1, 14 × 1, 28 × 1, 30 × 1, 60 × 1, 70 × 1, 90 × 1, and 100 × 1 film-coated tablets.

Not all pack sizes may be marketed in your country.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">jardiance</data>
  <data key="d5">jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf</data>
</node>
