"HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction", "Reference": "Khan Circ Heart Fail 2021", "AMA Style Guide References": "Khan Circ Heart Fail. 2021.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 125, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001781", "Match Text": "Rapid initiation of the 4 pillars of HFrEF GDMT is key to optimising outcomes", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Efficacy, Guidelines", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "GDMT=guideline-redirected medical therapy; HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction", "Reference": "2021 - Rapid evidence-based sequencing of foundational drugs for heart failure and a reduced ejectio", "AMA Style Guide References": "Rapid evidence-based sequencing of foundational drugs for heart failure and a reduced ejectio. 2021.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 126, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001774", "Match Text": "Treat early to reduce the risk of hospitalisation or CV death in your patients with HFrEF", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Efficacy", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "CV=cardiovascular; HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction", "Reference": "Jardiance - EU/SmPC", "AMA Style Guide References": "- EU/SmPC.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 127, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001775", "Match Text": "In the 2022 AHA/ACC/HFSA Guideline for the Management of HF, JARDIANCE, as an SGLT2i, is recommended for adult patients with HFrEF", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Guidelines", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "ACC=American College of Cardiology; ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; AHA=American Heart Association; HF=heart failure; HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction; SGLT2i=sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitor", "Reference": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol 2022 ", "AMA Style Guide References": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol. 2022.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 128, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001776", "Match Text": "In the 2022 AHA/ACC/HFSA Guideline for the Management of HF, JARDIANCE, as an SGLT2i, is recommended for adult patients with HFpEF", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Guidelines", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "ACC=American College of Cardiology; ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; AHA=American Heart Association; HF=heart failure; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; SGLT2i=sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitor", "Reference": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol 2022", "AMA Style Guide References": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol. 2022.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 129, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001777", "Match Text": "Despite being recommended across guidelines for early use in patients with HFrEF, SGLT2is continue to be underutilised", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Efficacy, Guidelines", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction; SGLT2i=sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitor", "Reference": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol 2022\n\nMcDonagh TA, Metra M, Adamo M, et al. Eur Heart J 2023\n\nRD-169473 McDonagh TA et al. 2021 Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599-3726", "AMA Style Guide References": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol. 2022.\n\nMcDonagh TA, Metra M, Adamo M, et al. Eur Heart J. 2023.\n\nMcDonagh TA et al. 2021 Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599-3726.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}, {"row_number": 130, "cells": {"Resource": "Yashaswini", "Name": "CL-CRP-001778", "Match Text": "Your patients with HFrEF require urgent and appropriate intervention with foundational treatments like SGLT2is", "Country of Origin": "Corporate", "Brand": "JARDIANCE", "Therapeutic Area": "Metabolism", "Lifecycle State": "Approved for Use", "Indication": null, "Key Message Type": "Disease Awareness, Efficacy, Guidelines", "End Audience": "HCP (Health Care Personnel)", "Contextual Information": null, "Footnotes": "HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction; SGLT2i=sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitor", "Reference": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol 2022\n\nRD-169473 McDonagh TA et al. 2021 Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599-3726\"", "AMA Style Guide References": "Heidenreich PA et al., J Am Coll Cardiol. 2022.\n\nMcDonagh TA et al. 2021 Eur Heart J. 2021;42(36):3599-3726.", "Content Modules &amp; Rule Sets": "NA"}}]}</data>
