  <data key="d44">{"sheet_name": "Excluded Claims", "columns": ["#", "Original Extracted Text", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)", "Indication", "Reference"], "rows": [{"row_number": 2, "cells": {"#": "1", "Original Extracted Text": "Time to cardiovascular benefits of empagliflozin: a post hoc observation from the EMPA-REG OUTCOME trial.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "EMPA-REG OUTCOME | 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.94"}}, {"row_number": 3, "cells": {"#": "2", "Original Extracted Text": "kidney-trial-showed-significant-benefit-jardiancer", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.182; 2026 PCP iVA p.78"}}, {"row_number": 4, "cells": {"#": "3", "Original Extracted Text": "landmark-empa-kidney-trial-showed-significant-benefit-jardiancer", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.179"}}, {"row_number": 5, "cells": {"#": "4", "Original Extracted Text": "Early benefit with empagliflozin in heart failure with preserved ejection fraction: insights from the EMPEROR-Preserved Trial.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA p.71"}}, {"row_number": 6, "cells": {"#": "5", "Original Extracted Text": "Effect of empagliflozin on the clinical stability of patients with heart failure and a reduced ejection fraction: the EMPEROR-Reduced trial.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.92; 2026 Card iVA p.29; 2026 PCP iVA p.112"}}, {"row_number": 7, "cells": {"#": "6", "Original Extracted Text": "Effects of empagliflozin on cardiovascular and renal outcomes in heart failure with reduced ejection fraction according to age: a secondary analysis of EMPEROR-Reduced.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim", "Indication": "Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "EMPEROR-Reduced | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.40"}}, {"row_number": 8, "cells": {"#": "7", "Original Extracted Text": "*Adult patients with an eGFR ≥20 mL/min/1.73 m2, &lt;45 mL/min/1.73 m2; or an eGFR ≥45 mL/min/1.73 m2, &lt;90 mL/min/1.73 m2 with a uACR ≥200 mg/g.2", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- footnote containing only numerical values without complete contextual meaning has been incorrectly identified as a claim.", "Indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Endo iVA p.82; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 Card iVA p.188; 2026 PCP iVA p.41; 2026 PCP iVA p.71; 2026 PCP iVA p.80; 2026 PCP iVA p.84"}}, {"row_number": 9, "cells": {"#": "8", "Original Extracted Text": "Evidence of CKD at risk of progression (measured over ≥3-month", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "The claim is incorrect and as per source the sentence is \"Evidence of CKD at risk of progression (measured over ≥3-month  period prior to and at the time of screening visit)\" which do no not have contexual meaning", "Indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.71; 2026 Card iVA p.174; 2026 PCP iVA p.73"}}, {"row_number": 10, "cells": {"#": "9", "Original Extracted Text": "associations of eGFR and albuminuria with mortality and kidney outcomes.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim-footnote  without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. ", "Indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.9"}}, {"row_number": 11, "cells": {"#": "10", "Original Extracted Text": "(defined as hospitalisation for coronary disease,", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- sentence without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. ", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.66; 2026 PCP iVA p.67"}}, {"row_number": 12, "cells": {"#": "11", "Original Extracted Text": "Reduction in risk of CV death was independent of†1,2:", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This claim is incomplete and incorrect identified claim. As per the source asset, this content is presented as the page title/header and does not constitute a standalone claim.", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.68; 2026 Card iVA p.153; 2026 PCP iVA p.101"}}, {"row_number": 13, "cells": {"#": "12", "Original Extracted Text": "failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death,", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- sentence without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.\n\nAs per source the sentence is present in below claim\n\" SGLT2is are a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy  for patients with HFrEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death, making JARDIANCE 1 of 4 foundational treatments  for HFrEF \"", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25"}}, {"row_number": 14, "cells": {"#": "13", "Original Extracted Text": "(JARDIANCE, 1611 hospitalisations in 960 patients; placebo, 1895 hospitalisations in 1035 patients).1", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- Incomplete sentence from footnote without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. \n\nAs per source the complete claim is \"Hospitalisation for any cause was a key secondary outcome of the EMPA-KIDNEY trial. The analysis of hospitalisations for any cause included the first and all subsequent events (JARDIANCE, 1611 hospitalisations in 960 patients; placebo, 1895 hospitalisations in 1035 patients).\"", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 PCP iVA p.80"}}, {"row_number": 15, "cells": {"#": "14", "Original Extracted Text": "*Patients with CAD, PAD, or history of MI or stroke.2", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "incorrect claim-footnote without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. ", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA p.100"}}, {"row_number": 16, "cells": {"#": "15", "Original Extracted Text": "Mean survival times decline with every HF hospitalisation3", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This claim is  incorrectly identified claim. As per the source asset, this content is presented as a title for graph and does not constitute a standalone claim.", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.8; 2026 Card iVA p.53"}}, {"row_number": 17, "cells": {"#": "16", "Original Extracted Text": "Mean survival times for the first, second, third, and fourth hospitalisations were all significant (p&lt;0.0001) and as follows: 2.6 (95% CI: 2.62, 2.65), 1.8 (95% CI: 1.76, 1.81), 1.5 (95% CI: 1.42, 1.50), and 1.3 (95% CI: 1.25, 1.37) years, respectively.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. ", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.8; 2026 Card iVA p.53"}}, {"row_number": 18, "cells": {"#": "17", "Original Extracted Text": "death from CV causes, hospitalisation for any cause (including the first and any subsequent hospitalisations), and death from any cause​", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.71; 2026 Card iVA p.174; 2026 PCP iVA p.73"}}, {"row_number": 19, "cells": {"#": "18", "Original Extracted Text": "endpoint plus hospitalisation for unstable angina", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.59; 2026 Card iVA p.143; 2026 PCP iVA p.86"}}, {"row_number": 20, "cells": {"#": "19", "Original Extracted Text": "†Hospitalisation for any cause was a key secondary outcome of the EMPA-KIDNEY trial. The analysis of hospitalisations for any cause included the first and all subsequent events", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "The claim is incorrect and the footnote without contexual meaning identified as claim", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 PCP iVA p.80"}}, {"row_number": 21, "cells": {"#": "20", "Original Extracted Text": "been shown to improve clinical outcomes in adult patients with HFrEF.1", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim and the sentence is from the footnote without contexual meaning.", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.127"}}, {"row_number": 22, "cells": {"#": "21", "Original Extracted Text": "†Based on claims data sources of adult patients with HFrEF in Japan (Medical Data Vision claims registry), Sweden (nationwide administrative registries), and the United States", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim and the sentence is from the footnote without contexual meaning.", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.127"}}, {"row_number": 23, "cells": {"#": "22", "Original Extracted Text": "‡Hospitalisation for HF was a secondary CV outcome in the EMPA-REG OUTCOME® trial (HR=0.65; 95% CI: 0.50, 0.85).1", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim and the sentence is from the footnote without contexual meaning.", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "EMPA-REG OUTCOME | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.111; 2026 PCP iVA p.93"}}, {"row_number": 24, "cells": {"#": "23", "Original Extracted Text": "Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of &gt;300 pg/mL or, for patients with atrial fibrillation at baseline, a level of &gt;900 pg/mL.2 CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; HF=heart failure; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NT-proBNP=N-terminal pro-brain natriuretic peptide; NY- HA=New York Heart Association.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. The sentence is from the footnote and abbreviations without contexual meaning.", "Indication": "Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.105"}}, {"row_number": 25, "cells": {"#": "24", "Original Extracted Text": "Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of &gt;300 pg/mL or, for patients with atrial fibrillation at baseline, a level of &gt;900 pg/mL.2 CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; HF=heart failure; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NT-proBNP=N-terminal pro-brain natriuretic peptide; NYHA=New York Heart Association.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. It footnote and abbreviations without contexual meaning.", "Indication": "Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157"}}, {"row_number": 26, "cells": {"#": "25", "Original Extracted Text": "eGFR (CKD-EPI) ≥60 mL/min/1.73 m2 at baseline (HR=0.81; 95% CI: 0.65, 1.00); eGFR (CKD-EPI) &lt;60 mL/min/1.73 m2 at baseline (HR=0.78; 95% CI: 0.66, 0.91).2 ARR=absolute risk reduction; CKD-EPI=Chronic Kidney Disease Epidemiology Collaboration; CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; HF=heart failure; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NNT=number needed to treat; NYHA=New York Heart Association; RRR=relative risk reduction.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.55"}}, {"row_number": 27, "cells": {"#": "26", "Original Extracted Text": "ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; CV=cardiovascular; HF=heart failure; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NYHA=New York Heart Association.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.57"}}, {"row_number": 28, "cells": {"#": "27", "Original Extracted Text": "ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; CV=cardiovascular; HF=heart failure; HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NYHA=New York Heart Association.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.12"}}, {"row_number": 29, "cells": {"#": "28", "Original Extracted Text": "AE=adverse event; CI=confidence interval; CV=cardiovascular; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; PY=patient year.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.39; 2026 Card iVA p.82"}}, {"row_number": 30, "cells": {"#": "29", "Original Extracted Text": "ARR=absolute risk reduction; CI=confidence interval; CV=cardiovascular; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; HR=hazard ratio; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NNT=number needed to treat; NYHA=New York Heart Association; RRR=relative risk reduction.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.70"}}, {"row_number": 31, "cells": {"#": "30", "Original Extracted Text": "Act early to reduce the risk of CV death or HHF1", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrect claim- The title is identified as claim. However, it is not specifying or do not have contexual information", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.8; 2026 Card iVA p.53"}}, {"row_number": 32, "cells": {"#": "31", "Original Extracted Text": "Time to first event of adjudicated CV death or adjudicated hospitalisation for HF", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "The sentence incorrectly identified as claim and this is a sentence without contexual information", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.84; 2026 Card iVA p.156; 2026 PCP iVA p.104"}}, {"row_number": 33, "cells": {"#": "32", "Original Extracted Text": "§Background treatment: All appropriate treatments for HF or comorbid conditions could be initiated or altered at the discretion of the clinician.2 CI=confidence interval; CV=cardiovascular; HF=heart failure; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; HR=hazard ratio; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NYHA=New York Heart Association; RRR=relative risk reduction.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source these are abbreviations", "Indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.73"}}, {"row_number": 34, "cells": {"#": "33", "Original Extracted Text": "*Adult patients with insufficiently controlled T2D and CAD, PAD, or a history of MI or stroke.1", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source this is footnote without contexual information.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.31; 2026 Endo iVA p.35"}}, {"row_number": 35, "cells": {"#": "34", "Original Extracted Text": "Help your patients with T2D, like Joana, do what they love by protecting", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. The given sentence is a part of title in the page without contexual information.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.53"}}, {"row_number": 36, "cells": {"#": "35", "Original Extracted Text": "†Key inclusion criteria: adult patients with type 2 diabetes and established CV disease (CAD, PAD, or a history of MI or stroke), HbA1c 7%-10%, BMI ≤45 kg/m2. Key exclusion criteria:", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrect claim, key inclusion and exclusion criteria without a contexual information identified as claim", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA; 2026 PCP iVA p.87"}}, {"row_number": 37, "cells": {"#": "36", "Original Extracted Text": "Joana, a patient with T2D, and James, a patient with CKD, need protection by reducing their risk of CV death so they can continue to do what they love1-3", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "The sentence is complete and however we cannot consider as a claim as it is a title and the sentence talking abou imaginary patients.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.11"}}, {"row_number": 38, "cells": {"#": "37", "Original Extracted Text": "†Key inclusion criteria: adult patients with type 2 diabetes and eCVD (CAD, PAD, or a history of MI or stroke), HbA1c 7%-10%, BMI ≤45 kg/m2. Key exclusion criteria: eGFR &lt;30 mL/", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "Incorrectly identified as claim and the given sentence is a footnote without contexual meaning ", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA p.60"}}, {"row_number": 39, "cells": {"#": "38", "Original Extracted Text": "Diabetes with poor-control HbA1c is cardiovascular disease ‘risk equivalent’ for mortality: UK Biobank and Hong Kong population-based cohort study.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is incorrectly identified as claim. As per source this is reference.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.7"}}, {"row_number": 40, "cells": {"#": "39", "Original Extracted Text": "BMI=body mass index; CI=confidence interval; CKD=chronic kidney disease; CKD-EPI=Chronic Kidney Disease Epidemiology Collaboration; CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; HF=heart failure; HFrEF=heart failure with reduced ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; HR=hazard ratio; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NYHA=New York Heart Association; RRR=relative risk reduction; T2D=type 2 diabetes.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This LOA, not claim. Present in reference as mentioned.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.166"}}, {"row_number": 41, "cells": {"#": "40", "Original Extracted Text": "BMI=body mass index; CI=confidence interval; CKD=chronic kidney disease; CKD-EPI=Chronic Kidney Disease Epidemiology Collaboration; CV=cardiovascular; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; HHF=hospitalisation for heart failure; HR=hazard ratio; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; NYHA=New York Heart Association; RRR=relative risk reduction; T2D=type 2 diabetes.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This LOA, not claim. Present in reference as mentioned.", "Indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.169"}}, {"row_number": 42, "cells": {"#": "41", "Original Extracted Text": "As compared with the guideline, how do you prioritise treatment for your patients with HFpEF?", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not a claim and even not cited with any reference. ", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.59"}}, {"row_number": 43, "cells": {"#": "42", "Original Extracted Text": "As compared with the guideline, how do you prioritise treatment for your patients with HFrEF?", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not a claim and even not cited with any reference. ", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.14"}}, {"row_number": 44, "cells": {"#": "43", "Original Extracted Text": "*Please see the SmPC for the full list of AEs and full list of special warnings and precautions for use, as well as dosing details.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not a claim. However, it is present in the stated reference.", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.38; 2026 PCP iVA p.48"}}, {"row_number": 45, "cells": {"#": "44", "Original Extracted Text": "Probability of &gt;20% insulin dose increase (%)", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not a claim. It is y-axis label. It is present in the stated reference.", "Indication": "General", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.29"}}, {"row_number": 46, "cells": {"#": "45", "Original Extracted Text": "ADA=American Diabetes Association; CKD=chronic kidney disease; eGFR=estimated glomerular filtration rate; KDIGO=Kidney Disease: Improving Global Outcomes; uACR=urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not a claim", "Indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.68"}}, {"row_number": 47, "cells": {"#": "46", "Original Extracted Text": "ACC=American College of Cardiology; ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; AHA=American Heart Association; ARB=angiotensin receptor blocker; ARNi=angiotensin receptor-neprilysin inhibitor; HF=heart failure; HFpEF=heart failure with preserved ejection fraction; HFSA=Heart Failure Society of America; LVEF=left ventricular ejection fraction; MRA=mineralocorticoid receptor antagonist; NYHA=New York Heart Association; SGLT2i=sodium-glucose cotransporter-2 inhibitor.", "Reason for Exclusion (Observation)": "This is not the claim, this are abbreviations ", "Indication": "Heart failure", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.60"}}, {"row_number": 48, "cells": {"#": "47", "Original Extracted Text": "ACC=American College of Cardiology; ACEi=angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor; AHA=American Heart Association; ARB=angiotensin receptor blocker; ARNi=angiotensin receptor-neprilysin inhibitor; HF=heart failure; HFrEF=heart failure with re