<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:9c6659e6-588c-408a-af89-f5058b783506">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">162</data>
  <data key="d7">82</data>
  <data key="d8">66</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">127db073-501f-4ba3-96f7-12103bd3f408</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">86ed3842325bbb4ae53394fcffc5e2f333055496f166ce749c70ede4a82e593f</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">9c6659e6-588c-408a-af89-f5058b783506</data>
  <data key="d16">The tagline communicates Boehringer Ingelheim's commitment to advancing the treatment and management of IPF with the medical community. We are dedicated to looking at IPF in a different way in order to improve the lives of patients with IPF.

The tagline should always appear in close proximity to the Boehringer Ingelhiem logo.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:ef85817d-010b-44f6-a818-db7eedf68901">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">163</data>
  <data key="d7">80</data>
  <data key="d8">67</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">a1565e89-6b42-4f6e-b26a-4ff9e5a54791</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">fd23bdc5cc93d3aeca3a8f49abb4086b094d2faf2809a667ae17dcb3853b1ec7</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">ef85817d-010b-44f6-a818-db7eedf68901</data>
  <data key="d16">The key elements of the campaign-the visual, headline, tagline, and secondary graphics-are all designed to illustrate the unpredictable and devastating nature of IPF. All the elements complement one another and work synergistically to communicate the urgency of the disease state.

BrocHurE coVEr ExAMPLE

