  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">0aa46c56-c5e1-4265-b5dd-8c8bfe99e5e8</data>
  <data key="d16">The unbranded colors were chosen to convey feelings of hope and encouragement.

