<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:4186f6f5-9922-4626-a7d4-1795188152a9">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">180</data>
  <data key="d7">125</data>
  <data key="d8">77</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">22871919-5050-4ac5-ad6f-3e7ac5323e58</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">f01f8df9d6d766c0224292fbafd2f2019f26b46ff762395351bab78e0d216f52</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">4186f6f5-9922-4626-a7d4-1795188152a9</data>
  <data key="d16">The clinical trial visual assets for OFEV ® are designed, managed, and used in promotional materials in a recognizable way, as established by our Clinical Trial Visual Identity System. The system helps to unify our materials, creating a consistent, flexible, and ownable visual communication style that is maintained across all channels.

Developing a strong and consistent link between strategic and design elements is essential to the overall success and recognition of study-related communications.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:5829d303-a218-4ef2-803d-81c4e0aabdcd">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">181</data>
  <data key="d7">98</data>
  <data key="d8">78</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">280ae365-b37a-47f3-a039-1b441d0ab689</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">71253bd666809651b0b91e1893bb48ea73a8e58191e1b3fb32e3cbe249f8328e</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">5829d303-a218-4ef2-803d-81c4e0aabdcd</data>
  <data key="d16">The following pages provide details on use of the clinical trial identity assets for OFEV ® . These assets have been created for use in study-related communications; clear direction is provided for utilizing visual elements.

This section will guide you on how to utilize the unbranded elements, including color palette, typography, templates, and grid systems. Follow these guidelines closely.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:8ff7ee90-d9d1-4f12-bc98-0235599a6fa1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">182</data>
  <data key="d7">66</data>
  <data key="d8">79</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">56af75fc-c480-4feb-8350-7b48c6c65c02</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">62217f862eb8f99f2e797e96510167985adb41216fa36bbad3682ad090374d31</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">8ff7ee90-d9d1-4f12-bc98-0235599a6fa1</data>
  <data key="d16">Our clinical trial logo consists of 2 elements: the trial name and the symbol. The symbol depicts a hummingbird, representing vigor and energy. The dark blue, all-caps typeface in the trial name communicates innovation and intelligence.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

triAL nAME</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:d3acfb71-7fb6-47fd-9399-68306ec06582">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">183</data>
  <data key="d7">54</data>
  <data key="d8">80</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">971ba75f-0ca6-4f47-aefe-3f2045e45250</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">5cf4fd4cecd68d72781805523700c78dc9d780c803f14ad3f7c01f903e51ab5b</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">d3acfb71-7fb6-47fd-9399-68306ec06582</data>
  <data key="d16">There are 6 individual clinical trial names, each with its own logo. These assets are available for download.

LoGo FAMiLY

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:664c258a-a5d1-430e-96b7-f91eeb448bea">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">184</data>
  <data key="d7">159</data>
  <data key="d8">81</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">309b47f4-7d60-44d0-ac8c-35905423838e</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">d9af25c7807c6891abe2c7903739ac5d505141ce850e24758a77f06c54ae92a9</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">664c258a-a5d1-430e-96b7-f91eeb448bea</data>
  <data key="d16">Clear space is the recommended area of white or an empty space surrounding the INPULSIS ® -1 logo. 100% of the cap height of the logotype is equal to 1x. A minimum clear space of 1x should be maintained around the entire mark at all times.

Minimum size is the smallest size at which our brandmark can be reproduced. The minimum size of the INPULSIS ® -1 brandmark is 7/8' (22mm) in width for print and 125 pixels in width for digital applications. For legibility reasons, the brandmark should never be smaller than that.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

cLEAr SPAcE

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

MiniMuM SizE

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Print: 7/8' (22 mm) diGitAL: 125 PixELS</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
