  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">186</data>
  <data key="d7">161</data>
  <data key="d8">82</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">6a3f0f49-45f8-4651-8367-36706164a224</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">c7ac7dfbb14b51ecc174456e73932da0983f4e8a8942bf948d809c77215d29ee</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">4c7beca7-9f1f-44f4-afbd-6b1946a314a1</data>
  <data key="d16">The preferred use of the INPULSIS ® -1 logo is the CMYK version on white background.

The CMYK and PMS logos are used when printing communication pieces. When printing in black and white, use the grayscale version of the logo. The RGB version of the logo is used for design pieces intended for electronic use such as interfaces, websites, and PowerPoint documents.

cMYK

