  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">45a8b21dc86b5514277e280314f887af01707d3e983b0709da3ff250c2eb93e3</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">41ba0a0a-ed5b-4d97-93f2-fa3db8f8fd31</data>
  <data key="d16">The illustrations work to support the scientific content, while bringing a sense of warmth and approachability. The simple and iconic shapes were designed in a specific style to fit the brand personality.

The illustrations have a wide range of use and can be used as a cluster or to connect areas of content.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

