<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:869facea-ccd7-4db7-915f-025d4c66830f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">91</data>
  <data key="d7">130</data>
  <data key="d8">25</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3337f9c8-fb07-47d0-b7ef-51734089cd34</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">765513c17764907d670aea69fe98937d94d859b699f67f819ab9aef192c8d730</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">869facea-ccd7-4db7-915f-025d4c66830f</data>
  <data key="d16">A grid provides the underlying structure for the page layout, in addition to maximum flexibility for text, color, and image placement. To ensure consistency throughout all OFEV ®  communications, we have developed a vertical grid and a horizontal grid.

The vertical grid has 8 columns and the horizontal grid has 8 columns. For doublepage spreads, the grid on the left page mirrors that of the right, allowing the inner and outer margins to be maintained while providing flexibility in choice of binding.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
