<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:f00cf2eb-6bfe-4899-a964-900913611667">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">95</data>
  <data key="d7">82</data>
  <data key="d8">28</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">c32f82a0-7397-487b-b65d-1cbb6df7becd</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">7f0f47028247cd5ea9b472311998a315b15eadd221e82e5ae7bcdf9d7f083c1b</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">f00cf2eb-6bfe-4899-a964-900913611667</data>
  <data key="d16">The brand identity system is the recognizable way in which all of our brand identity assets are designed, managed, and used in all of our communication materials.

Our brand identity system unifies our brand in a consistent, flexible, and ownable way across all channels, allowing us to communicate consistently to all audiences.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:b39c0e0b-0a12-414f-8d77-4efbdd5d8798">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">141</data>
  <data key="d7">73</data>
  <data key="d8">54</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">38252ec6-7815-4802-b76b-a5669c4f5de3</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">482452a27c950a222ade66cebfa227dc868e5d22893856664535907e518e15fc</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">b39c0e0b-0a12-414f-8d77-4efbdd5d8798</data>
  <data key="d16">Assets such as typeface, color, and graphics together form our brand identity system, through which we achieve our unique look and feel. All of these elements were created to work together harmoniously and reffect the oFEV ®  brand personality.

PAtiEnt BrocHurE coVEr ExAMPLE

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:27c0e2df-cb36-4308-b8c5-df676e3ebeab">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">82</data>
  <data key="d7">84</data>
  <data key="d8">22</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">04476e36-8a43-4bb4-aada-998924622c29</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">41ecf7c61572501a563751bb28759d622771a74b5f1173282a6adb3429148ea4</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">27c0e2df-cb36-4308-b8c5-df676e3ebeab</data>
  <data key="d16">A line pattern inspired by the core campaign has been incorporated into the Guardian Blue shape in our secondary graphic. The change of the angle in the line pattern reinforces the idea that OFEV ®  is changing the path of IPF.

This line pattern should only appear within the Guardian Blue shape in our secondary graphic.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:d9f8dcbd-5138-4538-8e15-7408a83cc660">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">100</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
  <data key="d8">31</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">c0dbb8e3-9d0f-4362-a898-c28975672610</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">8c92bebd740430af1b95f3b0deb80df3b03cc6f9d8417b1dffb75d5c37c707b5</data>
