  <data key="d15">8be15576-14fd-40ea-a499-a3e27e31eb87</data>
  <data key="d16">The primary font selected for the clinical trial branding is Chalet. Progressive and scientific, Chalet complements the logo well; it is also the font in which the trial names are set. The secondary font used for body copy is Helvetica Neue Roman.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Aa Headlines should be Chalet-London Nineteen Seventy sentence case SUBHEADS SHOULD BE CHALET-NEW YORK NINETEEN SEVENTY

Body copy should be Helvetica Neue Roman sentence case in 80%K. Body call-outs should be in Helvetica Neue Bold.

Call-outs should be Chalet-London Nineteen Seventy sentence case</data>
