  <data key="d15">7809cec7-e3fc-419f-845b-bddff06aacb6</data>
  <data key="d16">The key elements of the campaign-the visual, headline, tagline, and secondary graphics-are all designed to reinforce the idea that OFEV ®  slows disease progression. All the elements complement one another and work synergistically to communicate the key brand benefit in a clear and compelling way.

