  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">e8a52d2d-8491-4b3f-ab5c-8ce44f6b45b5</data>
  <data key="d16">The patients depicted in the existing campaign have been photographed in a neutral setting to provide additional flexibility and utility throughout multiple communication platforms.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
