  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">b6e45fb430c3bd4ccdecfed36f8807aea476cf395f344a0f0ab5c274b90daab0</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">22dede4a-74b0-47f6-a8b2-d43a570a9c0d</data>
  <data key="d16">Typography is another important element of our brand identity and a way to express our personality. The OFEV ®  primary fonts are Co Text Bold and Co Text Light. Co Text complements the visual elements seen in the OFEV ®  symbol and is also the font that the OFEV ®  logotype is based on. The OFEV ®  secondary font, used for body copy, is the Gotham Family, including Gotham Book, Gotham Bold, and Gotham Italic.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

aa</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
