  <data key="d12">OFEV_PI.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">752c22700047d2b4c3df647264381391e74676bd5ad0a6458e1b9b1e7e9a705b</data>
  <data key="d14">c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c</data>
  <data key="d15">923b6ae3-d9c7-4097-965c-d6169fdeb01e</data>
  <data key="d16">weeks of entry into this trial, or n-acetyl cysteine and prednisone (greater than 15 mg/day or equivalent) within 2 weeks. The majority of patients were Caucasian (60%) or Asian (30%) and male (79%). Patients had a mean age of 67 years and a mean FVC percent predicted of 80%.</data>
