  <data key="d14">c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c</data>
  <data key="d15">337a23b5-7181-4292-8753-efd010791688</data>
  <data key="d16">No difference in survival was observed in an exploratory analysis of mortality over the whole trial (OFEV: n=10 (3.5%) vs. placebo: n=9 (3.1%)). The analysis of time to death over the whole trial resulted in a HR of 1.16 (95% CI: 0.47, 2.84).</data>
