  <data key="d13">bb267a14c422fe6c801e07376833f5f5a78fddd8dc31e814f36dc45d2bb3ebb2</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">4ad177ec-92b0-4b0c-99ab-23fe537a54f0</data>
  <data key="d16">This section presents the brand's unique position in the market, the distinctive promise the brand makes its audiences, and the personality and behavior that define the brand experience.</data>
