<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:716e2347-b0fb-4e2d-bc11-b4dbeb20a608">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">51</data>
  <data key="d7">55</data>
  <data key="d8">5</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">d98ea450-71ce-499d-b637-423fe513a69a</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">e098ce5d6158b296803fa2c9897e069b54018b76fd44722079fb78b47c200bbc</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">716e2347-b0fb-4e2d-bc11-b4dbeb20a608</data>
  <data key="d16">Nintedanib is a tyrosine kinase inhibitor that targets pathways involved in fibrosis.

OFEV ® slows IPF disease progression so that the physician's role is restored and patients can live tomorrow like they did yesterday.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
