<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:6f340619-ed8b-423b-8cc1-afe8bf76a7a8">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">53</data>
  <data key="d7">71</data>
  <data key="d8">6</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">456e0f85-2637-47da-9144-582b50c2628b</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">0523dea8d8b8ef45f26d92645b3018abdcd76da496ab62595d96b20ff212ebcd</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">6f340619-ed8b-423b-8cc1-afe8bf76a7a8</data>
  <data key="d16">OFEV ® slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function OFEV ® reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%

Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients Only 1 capsule twice a day ensures ease of dosing</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:8650f2e1-6dce-4550-9768-7ac8a8bbfe12">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">54</data>
  <data key="d7">68</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">5662eb42-d69c-4afe-a7e4-0d9a371ccb41</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">b8e8edcb7572e7bde7bf5b89105478d4180dfb615d821a6921c53f6b11a2dda8</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">8650f2e1-6dce-4550-9768-7ac8a8bbfe12</data>
  <data key="d16">Our brand positioning, an internal strategic statement, is the foundation of all branded communications. It shows how we want OFEV ®  to be perceived in the minds of customers, and it is essential that brand positioning be reflected in all our branded marketing efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:9124e088-3eec-4b99-9ca6-fcac4a8e926f">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">55</data>
  <data key="d7">116</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3e128188-269d-498c-a537-2a7ef88f114d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">67628c746d379468396995519e6923a10ad4838ce743347211a5f74e0af627f9</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">9124e088-3eec-4b99-9ca6-fcac4a8e926f</data>
  <data key="d16">iPF is devastating and unpredictable. Physicians are powerless, and patients live in fear.

the progressive loss of lung function erodes life and results in death by suffocation within 2-3 years of diagnosis.

While most patients experience gradually declining lung function, some also experience precipitous, commonly fatal drops known as acute exacerbations. these come without warning or known cause, and have a direct effect on accelerating disease progression.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:5c99cedd-14cc-4f27-812d-465cddb1b161">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">56</data>
  <data key="d7">257</data>
  <data key="d8">7</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">483a5465-a6a0-488a-a324-ea05be19c8f7</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">961e35fd5faa6f05a1128bbe78e2b3ddc828338589f854611b8abd3124ded659</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">5c99cedd-14cc-4f27-812d-465cddb1b161</data>
  <data key="d16">| For those feeling helpless when facing the devastating diagnosis and unpredictable progression of iPF                                          |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| oFEV ®                                                                                                                                         |
| is a breakthrough therapy that delivers what it promises                                                                                       |
| that slows disease progression in all iPF patient types by reliably reducing FVc decline and exacerbations with a convenient dosing regimen    |
| unlike the complexity and uncertainties of pirfenidone and other therapies                                                                     |
| So that physicians are confident to initiate treatment immediately after diagnosis, enabling patients to live tomorrow like they did yesterday |</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:b77ef460-eacb-4ba6-8915-3f073e3b1c99">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">57</data>
  <data key="d7">68</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
