  <data key="d13">4ebf07ee16804495a69ce905ba4482d92e202c24ae81bcd86d288f48d94fd08d</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">b77ef460-eacb-4ba6-8915-3f073e3b1c99</data>
  <data key="d16">Our brand personality encompasses the memorable persona our brand presents to the world and how we are perceived by our audiences. It includes how our brand looks, acts, and sounds, in human terms.

Together, the following traits define the brand personality of OFEV ® .</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:49937b56-88fc-40e9-b683-a6242e253768">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">58</data>
  <data key="d7">51</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">ee69b436-8a02-483a-9019-ad1801339b74</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">7cd4c5d19489d9255c64e605f38cb68052d231ba01e67f7755567c322d2950bc</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">49937b56-88fc-40e9-b683-a6242e253768</data>
  <data key="d16">Even when the others turn in or give up, i remain vigilant and proactively guard against potential pitfalls. Knowing that i stay on watch gives others strength through security and comfort.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
