  <data key="d15">7f9fcc2a-56f4-4b36-a7c6-f0b9dbb4f7f6</data>
  <data key="d16">+

My intelligence, confidence, and the pride i take in my work allow me to regularly achieve success. By becoming the gold standard, i inevitably raise the bar higher for all.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
