  <data key="d15">f14dffeb-f09c-48e4-b328-f2e9c8add6f2</data>
  <data key="d16">+

i do more than deliver hope; i give others a real reason to believe in me. By inspiring them to take action in a way they didn't believe they could, i permanently shift the paradigm.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

