<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7e9163a3-1bf1-411f-af8f-c549695f92dd">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">65</data>
  <data key="d7">99</data>
  <data key="d8">10</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3dbd4263-7db7-437f-a6c4-412c6c8916d0</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">3b522c1d51b9488d641abc8ac89ae9566f89dc76043ee2aead6c70d7e4c3d8c7</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">7e9163a3-1bf1-411f-af8f-c549695f92dd</data>
  <data key="d16">Brand identity assets are the tools that we use to define and communicate a brand's unique characteristics. They include visual elements such as a logo, color, and type, as well as verbal and behavioral elements such as tone of voice, style, and manner. The OFEV ® brand identity assets have been carefully developed to work together to create a bold, charismatic, and memorable visual impression.</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e0f6aea7-130d-4083-9fe3-50223fa0d459">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">66</data>
  <data key="d7">191</data>
  <data key="d8">11</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">74ba7b62-d92b-4327-9ba4-7052c1b100ec</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">a1abcded853a6b69e71affe0d1faf7dfb8d09d5f7b1418b4ffb7f42e24bd4fec</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">e0f6aea7-130d-4083-9fe3-50223fa0d459</data>
  <data key="d16">The OFEV ®  logo consists of 3 elements: the logotype, the symbol, and the generic name. The symbol depicts wings in motion that dependably guard patients. The symbol is inspiring and representational of high performance because of its forward motion. The use of dark blue and all caps in the logotype communicate reliability and vigilance.

The logo should never be changed in any way to keep the personality consistent worldwide.

uS LoGo

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Some markets have regulations about the size relationship between the brand and generic names. the united States, for which the oFEV ®  logo is illustrated here, has very speciffc rules regarding that relationship. Please use the assets that have been provided and approved for your region.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7dbf2957-c600-41fa-b0d3-1718a868a054">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">67</data>
  <data key="d7">80</data>
  <data key="d8">12</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">38b8e81a-af41-4c3a-9e9d-3ca01edcf351</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">60c72e8a9043dc5d2f8a2c353cb9fca286b1cf740583be3592244b23309d1338</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">7dbf2957-c600-41fa-b0d3-1718a868a054</data>
  <data key="d16">The VARGATEF ®  logo is provided for countries that will launch nintedanib under the brand name VARGATEF ®  for both the IPF and lung cancer indications. These countries are required to use the same brand name for both indications; therefore, use of the brand name OFEV ® is not permitted.

GLoBAL LoGo

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:chunk:43f8e335-4704-402b-a2e9-db53003e4474">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d6">68</data>
  <data key="d7">147</data>
  <data key="d8">13</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">65d2c824-63a6-469e-be0b-db9f6a41096c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">c567836099ee529efd4bc9e996d363432e6bf76a09219e39467736d075fa3d9e</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d15">43f8e335-4704-402b-a2e9-db53003e4474</data>
  <data key="d16">Clear space is the specified area of empty space surrounding our brandmark. Its use allows us to maintain our brandmark's visual integrity and impact. The 'O' height in 'OFEV ® ' scaled down to 75% of its original size represents 1x. A minimum clear space of 1x should be maintained around the entire mark at all times.

The minimum size of the OFEV ® brandmark is 7/8' (22 mm, 125 pixels) in width. To maintain legibility, the brandmark should never be smaller than this.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

cLEAr SPAcE

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

MiniMuM SizE

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Print: 7/8' (22 mm) diGitAL: 125 PixELS</data>
  <data key="d3">Chunk</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
