  <data key="d10">9145a320-c5e0-4d9e-92e5-60e0f39171ef</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_PI.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c</data>
  <data key="d16">150 mg:  brown, opaque, oblong, soft capsules imprinted in black with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol and "150". They are packaged in HDPE bottles with a child-resistant closure, available as follows: Bottles of 60 NDC:  0597-0145-60

100 mg:  peach, opaque, oblong, soft capsules imprinted in black with the Boehringer Ingelheim company symbol and "100". They are packaged in HDPE bottles with a child-resistant closure, available as follows: Bottles of 60                                        NDC:  0597-0143-60</data>
  <data key="d3">PISection</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
