<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:f6ac55d4-b4ca-4a20-b5dd-9c93c1cf6592">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Campaign Headline</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">42</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">f6ac55d4-b4ca-4a20-b5dd-9c93c1cf6592</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The campaign headline speaks directly to changing the decline in lung function to slow disease progression in IPF. It also serves as a strong call to action for HCPs. For too long, HCPs have felt helpless but now they have the power to change lives with OFEV ® , a long-awaited treatment for IPF.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
