<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:46e31506-ef1c-41da-aec2-d7ac6ad7f869">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Message Flow: Disease State</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">45</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">46e31506-ef1c-41da-aec2-d7ac6ad7f869</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The development of the core story flow was validated by market research. Beginning with disease state messages grounds the HCP in the severity of IPF. FVC decline in patients with IPF is highlighted to emphasize the need for a treatment to slow IPF progression and help transition to the branded story.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:8a05aa6f-e286-4141-81e2-4a4e4144ff57">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d19">body</data>
  <data key="d8">46</data>
