</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Message Flow: Branded</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">46</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The branded message flow is focused on the core selling messages for OFEV ® :

-  OFEV ®  slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function
- Also including patients with early disease (FVC &amp;gt;90% predicted), no honeycombing on HRCT, and concomitant emphysema
-  Only OFEV ®  reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%
-  Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients
-  Only 1 capsule, twice daily, ensures ease of dosing

These messages communicate the brand benefit and were the most motivating to the HCP audience during market research.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
