<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:621fb49b-8aa0-4741-9dac-5bee1399db07">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Patient Branded Identity System 5.0</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">48</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">621fb49b-8aa0-4741-9dac-5bee1399db07</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The patient branded identity system comprises key assets that are designed, managed, and used in a recognizable way across all of our branded materials that are patient facing.

Our identity system unifies our patient branded materials in a consistent, flexible, and ownable way across all channels, allowing us to communicate consistently with patients with IPF and their caregivers.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
