  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">Nintedanib is a tyrosine kinase inhibitor that targets pathways involved in fibrosis.

OFEV ® slows IPF disease progression so that the physician's role is restored and patients can live tomorrow like they did yesterday.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
