  <data key="d16">OFEV ® slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function OFEV ® reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%

Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients Only 1 capsule twice a day ensures ease of dosing</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
