<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:25116737-9f83-4ca0-b1b7-1e0ad434dbe4">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Brand Personality</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">25116737-9f83-4ca0-b1b7-1e0ad434dbe4</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">Our brand personality encompasses the memorable persona our brand presents to the world and how we are perceived by our audiences. It includes how our brand looks, acts, and sounds, in human terms.

Together, the following traits define the brand personality of OFEV ® .</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:ee69b436-8a02-483a-9019-ad1801339b74">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">ProtectIve</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">ee69b436-8a02-483a-9019-ad1801339b74</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">Even when the others turn in or give up, i remain vigilant and proactively guard against potential pitfalls. Knowing that i stay on watch gives others strength through security and comfort.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:e5cadae2-cd95-46af-b348-57c0370a76b2">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">relIaBle</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e5cadae2-cd95-46af-b348-57c0370a76b2</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">+

i believe the best partnerships are those that are sustainable. to foster these long-term relationships, i build trust by remaining transparent and behaving with unwavering consistency.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:2111349c-59d3-4c26-ad62-972f50ad18c1">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">hIgh-Performance</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">2111349c-59d3-4c26-ad62-972f50ad18c1</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">+

My intelligence, confidence, and the pride i take in my work allow me to regularly achieve success. By becoming the gold standard, i inevitably raise the bar higher for all.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:831bc60a-71f8-4171-94fb-890256a055fa">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">encouragIng</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">8</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">831bc60a-71f8-4171-94fb-890256a055fa</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">+

i do more than deliver hope; i give others a real reason to believe in me. By inspiring them to take action in a way they didn't believe they could, i permanently shift the paradigm.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
