  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">=

i am an essential and stabilizing force for everyone i touch. By always being protective, reliable, high-performing, and encouraging, i provide the vital foundation others need to achieve their best.</data>
