  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The brand identity system is the recognizable way in which all of our brand identity assets are designed, managed, and used in all of our communication materials.

Our brand identity system unifies our brand in a consistent, flexible, and ownable way across all channels, allowing us to communicate consistently to all audiences.</data>
