<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:0aaba83d-728c-40f8-9ab0-55b2b7ac4b4c">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Typography</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">60</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">0aaba83d-728c-40f8-9ab0-55b2b7ac4b4c</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">Typography is another important element of our unbranded identity and a way to communicate our personality.

Helvetica Neue Black Italic and Bold were selected for their strong sense of urgency and for assigning prominence to communication materials. They are also extremely legible in various font sizes.

In applications such as Microsoft ®  Word, Microsoft ®  PowerPoint, and programs with restrictive font sets, use Arial Regular for body text and Arial Bold Italic for headline and subheadline text.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Aa</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:8b33174e-a0cb-4a5f-abb4-75c44f985607">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">HEADLINE OR PAGE TITLE IN ALL CAPS HELVETICA NEUE BLACK ITALIC IN BLACK</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">60</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">8b33174e-a0cb-4a5f-abb4-75c44f985607</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">SUBTITLE IN ALL CAPS HELVETICA NEUE BLACK ITALIC IN TEAL

Page subheadline in sentence case Helvetica Neue Black Italic in teal

Body copy in sentence case Helvetica Neue Bold in black. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
