<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:e13195d5-70eb-4b93-bfa9-788e7dd45818">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Color Palette</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">61</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">e13195d5-70eb-4b93-bfa9-788e7dd45818</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">Color has the ability to affect human behavior, emotion, and memory. It helps convey our tone and makes us distinct.

Our color palette reflects our personality and achieves the urgency (black) and encouraging (teal) effect we want to express while unifying (taupe) our message.

A secondary palette of grays is available for use in charts and graphs. This secondary palette can also be used to provide additional design hierarchy when needed in complex layouts.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:1a391d36-4898-4488-b964-394116252214">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">6.3</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">62</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">1a391d36-4898-4488-b964-394116252214</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16"></data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:00a8dac1-51ad-420a-ad75-0eafb991f12b">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Secondary Graphics</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">62</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">00a8dac1-51ad-420a-ad75-0eafb991f12b</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">A secondary graphic is an additional brand element that adds visual distinction and unifies our brand across all of our touchpoints.

Our secondary graphic consists of the teal and black background, divided on a diagonal, and a white holding shape. The flexible background can be used across a whole page or scaled down as small as a footer graphic.

The white holding shape was designed to contain headline and subheadline text or photography. Silhouetted photography can be placed on the top of the background and/or the white holding shape, as shown below.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
