<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:214eca65-ca27-49f0-af14-a8dc20079943">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">Typography</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">84</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">214eca65-ca27-49f0-af14-a8dc20079943</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
  <data key="d12">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
  <data key="d14">7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2</data>
  <data key="d16">The primary font selected for the clinical trial branding is Chalet. Progressive and scientific, Chalet complements the logo well; it is also the font in which the trial names are set. The secondary font used for body copy is Helvetica Neue Roman.

&lt;!-- image --&gt;

Aa Headlines should be Chalet-London Nineteen Seventy sentence case SUBHEADS SHOULD BE CHALET-NEW YORK NINETEEN SEVENTY

Body copy should be Helvetica Neue Roman sentence case in 80%K. Body call-outs should be in Helvetica Neue Bold.

Call-outs should be Chalet-London Nineteen Seventy sentence case</data>
  <data key="d3">Section</data>
  <data key="d4">ofev</data>
  <data key="d5">OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf</data>
</node>
<node id="urn:kg:ofev:section:3e4e98c0-3b1f-4a3a-997e-f857798e2bcc">
  <data key="d0">brand</data>
  <data key="d20">8.8</data>
  <data key="d19">heading</data>
  <data key="d8">85</data>
  <data key="d9">brand_book</data>
  <data key="d10">3e4e98c0-3b1f-4a3a-997e-f857798e2bcc</data>
  <data key="d11">docling</data>
